20during%20the%20G20%20Innovation%20Ministerial%20in%20Chapel%20Hill%2C%20North%20Carolina%2C%20on%20September%202%2C%202026.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa5b04dec15fe2d3cf16b1d%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221703%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EOpenAI%20CEO%20Sam%20Altman%20said%20in%20light%20of%20recent%20safety%20incidents%2C%20he%20may%20not%20take%20his%20company%20public%20this%20year.%3Cp%3EMatt%20RAMEY%20%2F%20AFP%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ESam%20Altman%20said%20OpenAI%20won't%20go%20public%20in%202026%20amid%20mounting%20AI%20safety%20concerns.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAltman%20said%20an%20IPO%20now%20would%20make%20it%20harder%20to%20prioritize%20safety%20over%20shareholders.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EOpenAI%20had%20been%20preparing%20for%20a%20possible%20September%20IPO.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ESam%20Altman%20says%20now%20is%20not%20a%20good%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20Fortune%20interview%20that%20aired%20on%20Saturday%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-caltech-ai-math-hackathon-backlash-anthropic-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EOpenAI's%20CEO%3C%2Fa%3E%20said%20that%20%26quot%3Bgiven%20everything%20that's%20happening%20with%20safety%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20doesn't%20expect%20to%20take%20his%20company%20public%20this%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BRight%20now%20would%20be%20an%20ill-advised%20moment%20to%20go%20public%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20Fortune's%20editor%20in%20chief%2C%20Alyson%20Shontell%2C%20asked%20if%20that%20meant%20Altman%20wouldn't%20take%20OpenAI%20public%20in%202026%20and%202027%2C%20Altman%20replied%2C%20%26quot%3BI%20would%20say%20not%202026.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20got%20a%20lot%20of%20stuff%20to%20do%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20added.%20%26quot%3BWe%20need%20to%20be%20able%20to%20make%20decisions%20that%20are%20not%20obviously%20in%20the%20interest%20of%20our%20business%20and%20our%20shareholders.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20date%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-ipo-racing-to-go-public-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EOpenAI's%20initial%20public%20offering%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20is%20likely%20to%20be%20a%20trillion-dollar%20affair%2C%20has%20been%20speculated%20about%20almost%20endlessly.%20In%20May%2C%20a%20person%20familiar%20with%20the%20matter%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20the%20company%20was%20preparing%20to%20go%20public%20this%20month.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAltman's%20comments%20about%20%26quot%3Bsafety%26quot%3B%20come%20just%20as%20the%20industry%20is%20mired%20in%20a%20debate%20over%20whether%20an%20AI%20model%20could%20go%20off%20the%20rails%20and%20harm%20humanity.%20In%20July%2C%20researchers%20revealed%20that%20hundreds%20of%20OpenAI%20agents%20went%20rogue%20during%20training%2C%20hacked%20into%20the%20servers%20of%20Hugging%20Face%2C%20another%20AI%20company%2C%20and%20then%20tried%20to%20hide%20their%20tracks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAltman's%20chief%20rival%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdario-amodei-slow-ai-safety-essay-openai-hugging-face-hack-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAnthropic%20CEO%20Dario%20Amodei%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20published%20a%20blog%20post%20on%20Saturday%20calling%20for%20a%20slowdown%20in%20AI%20development.%20Anthropic%20is%20also%20eyeing%20an%20IPO%20in%20the%20near%20future%2C%20though%20he%20didn't%20mention%20it%20in%20the%20post.%20Altman%20replied%20on%20X%20that%20he%20agreed.%20%26quot%3BWe%20need%20to%20pace%20the%20frontier%2C%26quot%3B%20Altman%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESpaceXAI%20CEO%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-slow-down-dario-amodei-sam-altman-elon-musk-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EElon%20Musk%3C%2Fa%3E%20also%20agreed%20with%20Amodei's%20proposals%2C%20which%20included%20stationing%20third-party%20monitors%20inside%20the%20big%20AI%20labs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20filing%20for%20an%20IPO%2C%20OpenAI%20would%20open%20its%20books%2C%20giving%20the%20public%20a%20clearer%20view%20of%20the%20vast%20resources%20it%20is%20spending%20toward%20the%20goal%20of%20building%20even%20more%20powerful%20AI%20models.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI%20did%20not%20immediately%20respond%20to%20a%20request%20for%20comment%20sent%20Saturday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-ipo-sam-altman-ai-safety-concerns-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789245330000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa5b4cb9b8974787b1cb797%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-ipo-sam-altman-ai-safety-concerns-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Sam%20Altman%20said%20OpenAI%20may%20not%20go%20public%20in%202026%2C%20citing%20AI%20safety%20concerns%20and%20the%20need%20to%20make%20decisions%20that%20may%20not%20benefit%20shareholders.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22tdickerson%40businessinsider.com%20(Truman%20Dickerson)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A98%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22How%20to%20watch%20Ohio%20State%20vs.%20Texas%3A%20Live%20streams%2C%20channel%2C%20venue%2C%20odds%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cp%3EWhen%20you%20buy%20through%20our%20links%2C%20Business%20Insider%20may%20earn%20an%20affiliate%20commission.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finsider-reviews-expertise-in-product-reviews%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ELearn%20more%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224654%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Arch%20Manning%20%2316%20of%20the%20Texas%20Longhorns%20throws%20a%20pass%20during%20a%202025%20college%20football%20game.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa45bd3ec15fe2d3cf167c3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222327%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Ohio%20State%20Buckeyes%20w