%20on%20Saturday.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A96%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bbc.co.uk%2Fnews%2Fvideos%2Fcwyz11gk7y7o%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Influencers%20are%20urging%20Home%20Depot%20and%20Lowe's%20to%20drop%20Flock%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226013%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20Home%20Depot%20parking%20lot.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa463dbcc23a829a3b909e1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223007%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EHome%20Depot%20and%20Lowe's%2C%20two%20of%20the%20largest%20home-improvement%20retailers%20in%20the%20US%2C%20are%20being%20asked%20to%20drop%20their%20contracts%20with%20Flock.%3Cp%3EMarcin%20Golba%2FNurPhoto%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EFlock%20Safety%2C%20maker%20of%20automated%20license%20plate%20readers%2C%20has%20more%20than%205%2C000%20private-sector%20clients.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ESome%20consumers%20are%20now%20demanding%20that%20companies%20drop%20their%20contracts%20with%20Flock.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EA%20group%20of%20online%20creators%20launched%20a%20campaign%20demanding%20Home%20Depot%20and%20Lowe's%20end%20ties%20with%20Flock.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EA%20group%20of%20online%20creators%20with%20a%20combined%2046%20million%20followers%20is%20demanding%20Lowe's%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22http%3A%2F%2Fbusinessinsider.com%2Fhome-depot-salaries-tech-jobs-pay-2025-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EHome%20Depot%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20two%20of%20the%20largest%20home-improvement%20stores%20in%20the%20US%20%E2%80%94%20to%20cut%20ties%20with%20Flock%20Safety%20amid%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fflock-safety-license-plate-readers-retail-consumer-backlash-ulta-lowes-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Enationwide%20campaign%20against%20large%20retailers%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20may%20have%20contracts%20with%20the%20surveillance%20tech%20company.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20letter%20sent%20Friday%20morning%20to%20the%20companies'%20executives%2C%2056%20content%20creators%20called%20on%20Lowe's%20and%20Home%20Depot%20to%20%26quot%3Bterminate%20all%20its%20contracts%20with%20Flock%20Safety%26quot%3B%20and%20remove%20the%20company's%20automated%20license%20plate%20readers%2C%20or%20ALPRs%2C%20from%20their%20parking%20lots.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20letter%20raised%20concerns%20that%20data%20gathered%20by%20the%20cameras%20could%20be%20accessed%20by%20federal%20or%20local%20law%20enforcement%20agencies%20to%20target%20immigrant%20day%20laborers%20and%20other%20shoppers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BBy%20participating%20in%20Flock's%20network%2C%20you%20are%20endangering%20the%20safety%20of%20customers%2C%20especially%20the%20immigrants%20and%20people%20of%20color%20who%20shop%20at%20your%20stores%2C%26quot%3B%20an%20email%20that%20was%20sent%20to%20the%20executives%20and%20viewed%20by%20Business%20Insider%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fflock-cameras-license-plate-readers-explained-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EFlock%20cameras%3C%2Fa%3E%20collect%20license%20plate%20and%20vehicle%20data.%20A%20company%20spokesperson%20said%20Flock%20has%20more%20than%205%2C000%20private%20sector%20clients%2C%20including%20retailers%2C%20healthcare%20institutions%2C%20small%20businesses%2C%20and%20places%20of%20worship.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224444%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20Flock%20camera%20at%20a%20Lowe's%20parking%20lot.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa46576ec15fe2d3cf16844%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223333%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELowe's%20and%20Home%20Depot%20have%20installed%20Flock%20cameras%20in%20their%20parking%20lots.%3Cp%3EPaul%20Weaver%2FSOPA%20Images%2FLightRocket%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ELaw%20enforcement%20officers%20have%20previously%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fflock-safety-alpr-cameras-misreads-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EFlock's%20technology%3C%2Fa%3E%20has%20helped%20their%20agencies%20solve%20crimes.%20Flock%20says%20it%20helps%20businesses%20and%20communities%20prevent%20and%20investigate%20crime%2C%20including%20organized%20retail%20crime.%20Business%20Insider%20also%20has%20reported%20that%20Flock%20cameras%20can%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fflock-camera-misread-license-plate-reader-california-roseville-police-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emisread%20license%20plates%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20leading%20law%20enforcement%20to%20the%20wrong%20people.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%20has%20become%20a%20flash%20point%20amid%20broader%20concerns%20over%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-amending-contract-with-pentagon-amid-backlash-mass-surveillance-anthropic-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emass%20surveillance%3C%2Fa%3E%20technology%20and%20privacy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFight%20For%20The%20Future%2C%20a%20nonprofit%20digital%20rights%20advocacy%20group%20that%20organized%20the%20content%20creator-led%20campaign%2C%20has%20pointed%20to%20a%20May%202025%20report%20from%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.404media.co%2Fice-taps-into-nationwide-ai-enabled-camera-network-data-shows%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E404%20Media%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20found%20local%20and%20state%20police%20agencies%20were%20running%20searches%20in%20Flock's%20nationwide%20ALPR%20network%20for%20ICE%20and%20immigration-related%20probes.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20report%20did%20not%20establish%20that%20ICE%20itself%20had%20direct%20access%20to%20Flock's%20system%2C%20but%20showed%20how%20local%20agencies%20could%20use%20the%20network%20on%20ICE's%20behalf%20even%20though%20the%20federal%20agency%20does%20not%20have%20a%20formal%20contract%20with%20Flock.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20cities%2C%20from%20Austin%20to%20Evanston%2C%20Illinois%2C%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Emove%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fflock-safety-cameras-police-departments-lapd-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eend%20their%20contracts%20with%20Flock%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20organizations%20like%20Fight%20For%20The%20Future%20are%20putting%20similar%20pressure%20on%20retailers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20Flock%20spokesperson%20said%20private%20customers%20own%20and%20control%20the%20data%20collected%20by%20their%20systems%2C%20including%20decisions%20about%20access%2C%20sharing%2C%20and%20retention.%20%26quot%3BLaw%20enforcement%20cannot%20access%20a%20private%20customer's%20data%20without%20that%20customer's%20explicit%20authorization%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20spokesperson%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20Home%20Depot%20spokesperson%20said%20the%20cameras%20help%20prevent%20and%20investigate%20theft%2C%20fraud%2C%20and%20organized%20retail%20crime%2C%20as%20well%20as%20protect%20customers%20and%20employees.%20The%20retailer%20said%20it%20does%20not%20share%20ALPR%20data%20with%20immigration%20enforcement%20or%20grant%20federal%20law%20enforcement%20access%20to%20its%20license-plate%20readers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJess%20Rambo%2C%20a%20Marine%20veteran%20who%20now%20runs%20a%20homesteading%20and%20building%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EInstagram%20account%2C%20The%20Painted%20Buffalo%2C%20with%20about%2028%2C000%20followers%2C%20said%20she%20shops%20at%20her%20local%20Home%20Depot%20in%20rural%20Georgia%20at%20least%20twice%20a%20week.%20She%20said%20learning%20about%20Home%20Depot's%20use%20of%20ALPRs%20%E2%80%94%20and%20the%20potential%20for%20law-enforcement%20access%20to%20the%20data%20%E2%80%94%20prompted%20her%20to%20sign%20the%20letter.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20concern%20for%20me%20is%20definitely%20the%20data%20collection%20and%20the%20safety%20of%20people%20if%20that%20data%20were%20put%20into%20the%20wrong%20hands%2C%26quot%3B%20Rambo%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlexa%20Speed%2C%20another%20signatory%20of%20the%20letter%2C%20runs%20Cut%20Off%20the%20Spigot%20on%20Instagram%20and%20TikTok%2C%20as%20well%20as%20a%20Substack%20newsletter%20where%20she%20directs%20consumers%20to%20companies%20she%20considers%20problematic.%20Speed%20started%20the%20Instagram%20account%20in%20April%202025%20and%20has%20since%20gained%20more%20than%20417%2C000%20followers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESpeed%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20she%20published%20an%20article%20on%20her%20Substack%20and%20a%20video%20earlier%20this%20year%20about%20alternatives%20to%20Home%20Depot%20and%20Lowe's%20after%20seeing%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.404media.co%2Fhome-depot-and-lowes-share-data-from-hundreds-of-ai-cameras-with-cops%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eanother%20404%20Media%20report%3C%2Fa%3E%20detailing%20how%20local%20law%20enforcement%20can%20tap%20into%20the%20retailers'%20Flock%20surveillance%20systems.%20Joining%20Fight%20For%20The%20Future's%20campaign%20was%20a%20way%20to%20extend%20her%20advocacy%20to%20a%20%26quot%3Bcollective%20action.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20only%20meaningful%20response%20is%20to%20end%20and%20cancel%20their%20partnership%2C%26quot%3B%20Speed%20said.%20%26quot%3BI%20need%20to%20get%20a%20faucet%20or%20a%20wrench.%20I%20don't%20need%20to%20be%20surveilled.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20Lowe's%20spokesperson%20did%20not%20respond%20to%20a%20request%20for%20comment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EHave%20a%20tip%3F%20Contact%20this%20reporter%20via%20email%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Alloydlee%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cu%3Elloydlee%40businessinsider.com%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E%20or%20Signal%20at%20lloydlee.71.%20Use%20a%20personal%20email%20address%2C%20a%20nonwork%20WiFi%20network%2C%20and%20a%20nonwork%20device%3B%20here's%20our%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%