A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223175%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Anthropic%20CEO%20Dario%20Amodei%20at%20the%20company's%20developer%20conference%20in%20San%20Francisco%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F69fe2c85e1443b8dc48e35b4%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222113%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAnthropic%20CEO%20Dario%20Amodei%20says%20AI%20development%20needs%20to%20slow%20down.%3Cp%3EAndrej%20Sokolow%2Fpicture%20alliance%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EAnthropic%20CEO%20Dario%20Amodei%20says%20he's%20now%20'convinced'%20AI%20development%20needs%20to%20slow%20down.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAmodei%20cited%20OpenAI%20agents'%20Hugging%20Face%20hack%20as%20one%20reason.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20Anthropic%20CEO%20proposed%20a%20three-step%20plan%20for%20the%20AI%20industry%20to%20slow%20things%20down.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EAnthropic%20CEO%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdario-amodei%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EDario%20Amodei%3C%2Fa%3E%20says%20he's%20%26quot%3Bbecome%20convinced%26quot%3B%20in%20recent%20months%20that%20AI%20needs%20to%20slow%20down.%20And%20rogue%20OpenAI%20agents%20are%20part%20of%20the%20reason.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAmodei%20cited%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhugging-face-ceo-clem-delangue-openai-rogue-agent-hack-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EJuly%20Hugging%20Face%20breach%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%C2%A0in%20which%20OpenAI%20agents%20broke%20out%20of%20their%20testing%20environment%20to%20hack%20into%20the%20AI%20platform%20and%20then%20hide%20their%20tracks%2C%20as%20one%20of%20the%20catalysts%20for%20his%20heightened%20alarm.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BGiven%20the%20accelerating%20rate%20of%20AI%20capability%20development%2C%20it's%20my%20worry%20that%20in%206-12%20months%20such%20a%20swarm%20could%20be%20capable%20of%20taking%20over%20the%20entire%20internet%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote%20in%20a%20blog%20post%20published%20Saturday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI%20CEO%20Sam%20Altman%20said%20on%20Saturday%20that%20he%20agreed%20with%20Amodei.%20%26quot%3BWe%20need%20to%20pace%20the%20frontier%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%20on%20X.%20%26quot%3BThis%20has%20been%20a%20primary%20topic%20of%20discussions%20we've%20had%20at%20OpenAI%20in%20recent%20weeks.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EElon%20Musk%2C%20whose%20SpaceXAI%20competes%20with%20Anthropic%20and%20OpenAI%2C%20also%20backed%20Amodei's%20proposition%20on%20Saturday%2C%20writing%20in%20an%20X%20post%2C%20%26quot%3BDario%20is%20right.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAmodei%20also%20cited%20the%20rapid%20advancement%20of%20AI%20in%20recent%20months%20and%20its%20increased%20capacity%20for%20%26quot%3Brecursive%20self-improvement%2C%26quot%3B%20which%20is%20essentially%20an%20AI%20model's%20ability%20to%20learn%20on%20its%20own.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAmodei%20proposed%20a%20three-step%20plan%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-chief-scientist-ai-risks-slowdown-rogue-agents-consequences-safety-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eslow%20down%20AI%20development%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20ensure%20the%20tech's%20safety%20%26quot%3Bwhile%20still%20achieving%20its%20benefits%20and%20grappling%20with%20important%20geopolitical%20dilemmas.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECentral%20to%20Amodei's%20plan%20is%20embedding%20independent%20safety%20evaluators%20inside%20frontier%20AI%20companies%20like%20Anthropic%20and%20OpenAI%2C%20giving%20them%20%26quot%3Bemployee-like%20access%26quot%3B%20to%20the%20companies'%20systems%20and%20work.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThis%20is%20the%20key%20step%20for%20verifiability%3Cem%3E%20%3C%2Fem%3Eof%20any%20pacing%20commitments%2C%26quot%3B%20Amodei%20wrote.%20%26quot%3BAnthropic%20is%20unilaterally%20committing%20to%20this%20step%20now.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20his%20X%20post%2C%20Altman%20said%20OpenAI%20would%20also%20implement%20third-party%20evaluators%20into%20its%20company.%20%26quot%3BWe'll%20have%20more%20to%20share%20soon%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20AI%20community%20has%20been%20in%20a%20furor%20this%20week%20after%20Anthropic%20employee%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-researcher-quits-over-ai-safety-concerns-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EJacob%20Coxon%3C%2Fa%3E%20quit%2C%20issuing%20a%20public%20warning%20that%20AI%20agents%20could%20%26quot%3Bkill%20us%20all%20by%20the%20end%20of%20the%20decade.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECoxon's%20warnings%20were%20shared%20widely%20and%20signal-boosted%20by%20other%20Anthropic%20employees%2C%20one%20of%20whom%2C%20the%20company's%20alignment%20science%20lead%2C%20said%20on%20X%2C%20%26quot%3BJacob%20is%20correct%20here%E2%80%94we%20really%20do%20earnestly%20believe%20AI%20could%20kill%20all%20humans!%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Saturday%2C%20Coxon%20reposted%20Musk's%20%26quot%3BDario%20is%20right%26quot%3B%20post.%20Earlier%20in%20the%20week%2C%20Musk%20accused%20Coxon%20of%20orchestrating%20a%20%26quot%3Bsetup.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI's%20chief%20scientist%2C%20meanwhile%2C%20also%20said%20in%20a%20blog%20post%20last%20week%20that%20leading%20AI%20labs%20need%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-chief-scientist-ai-risks-slowdown-rogue-agents-consequences-safety-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecoordinate%20a%20slowdown%3C%2Fa%3E.%20%26quot%3BNo%20one%20is%20prepared%20for%20the%20consequences%20of%20a%20continued%20rapid%20rise%20in%20machine%20intelligence%2C%26quot%3B%20Jakub%20Pachocki%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI%20CEO%20Sam%20Altman%20reposted%20Pachocki's%20comments%20on%20X%2C%20calling%20it%20an%20%26quot%3Bimportant%20post.%26quot%3B%20Bloomberg%20reported%20this%20week%20that%2C%20during%20an%20employee%20meeting%2C%20Altman%20said%20OpenAI%20was%20willing%20to%20slow%20AI%20development%20in%20conjunction%20with%20rival%20labs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20his%20Saturday%20essay%2C%20Amodei%20reiterated%20previous%20calls%20for%20the%20US%20government%20to%20intervene%20and%20establish%20guidelines%20for%20American%20labs.%20The%20Trump%20administration%2C%20so%20far%2C%20has%20resisted%20regulating%20the%20American%20AI%20industry%20to%20maintain%20its%20narrowing%20lead%20over%20Chinese%20AI%20labs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDemocratic%20lawmakers%2C%20for%20their%20part%2C%20proposed%20stringent%20legislation%20this%20week%20that%20would%20severely%20hamper%20AI%20development.%20Sen.%20Bernie%20Sanders%2C%20in%20a%20recent%20interview%20with%20MSNOW%2C%20said%20AI%20companies%20%26quot%3Bneed%20to%20stop%20right%20now.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAmodei%20and%20other%20leading%20AI%20researchers%20and%20engineers%20have%20not%20argued%20for%20a%20full%20stop%20to%20development.%20In%20his%20essay%2C%20Amodei%20said%20American%20AI%20labs%20should%20continue%20developing%2C%20just%20with%20more%20robust%20safeguards.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20said%20there%20remains%20a%20need%20to%20compete%20with%20China%2C%20and%20said%20the%20Trump%20administration%20could%20ensure%20this%20by%20not%20selling%20the%20rival%20the%20advanced%20chips%20needed%20to%20power%20AI%20models.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20stakes%20are%20too%20high%20for%20pacing%20to%20be%20an%20empty%20exercise%20%E2%80%94%20we%20need%20to%20use%20the%20time%20it%20gives%20us%20wisely%2C%26quot%3B%20Amodei%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdario-amodei-slow-ai-safety-essay-openai-hugging-face-hack-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789231370000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa56221cc23a829a3b90c61%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdario-amodei-slow-ai-safety-essay-openai-hugging-face-hack-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Anthropic%20CEO%20Dario%20Amodei%20said%20in%20a%20new%20essay%20on%20Saturday%20that%