3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EUltimately%2C%20our%20trip%20to%20Portugal%20could've%20been%20much%20better%20if%20we'd%20avoided%20a%20few%20mistakes%20with%20packing%20and%20planning.%3Cp%3ETimothy%20Moore%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EWe%20spent%20two%20weeks%20in%20Portugal%20and%20had%20a%20wonderful%20time%2C%20but%20we%20made%20some%20major%20mistakes.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWe%20stayed%20in%20some%20spots%2C%20like%20Lisbon%2C%20for%20too%20long%2C%20and%20others%20not%20nearly%20long%20enough.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWe%20also%20packed%20poorly%20and%20made%20some%20poor%20booking%20decisions%2C%20including%20a%20hotel%20without%20a%20front%20desk.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20husband%20and%20I%20recently%20spent%20two%20weeks%20in%20Portugal.%20We%20had%20a%20great%20time%2C%20ate%20fantastic%20food%2C%20and%20drank%20a%20lot%20of%20wine%2C%20but%20it%20was%20also%20our%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fleast-favorite-places-to-travel-to-according-to-frequent-traveler-2024-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eleast%20favorite%20European%20vacation%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20date.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20outdoorsy%20travelers%2C%20we%20missed%20the%20hiking%20and%20adventure%20activities%20we%20usually%20prioritize.%20We%20also%20made%20some%20planning%20and%20packing%20mistakes%20that%20affected%20the%20trip.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%227ec966f0-c234-481b-bdc1-7ce1961b9f65%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EArriving%20later%20in%20the%20day%20would've%20been%20better%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22View%20of%20water%20and%20sand%20from%20glass%20balcony%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa0499aec15fe2d3cf14be4%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EView%20from%20our%20balcony%20in%20the%20Algarve.%3Cp%3ETimothy%20Moore%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20past%20European%20trips%2C%20we%20always%20had%20a%20plan%20for%20our%20luggage%20after%20landing%2C%20whether%20that%20meant%20a%20rental%20car%2C%20late%20arrival%2C%20or%20early%20hotel%20check-in.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20Portugal%20flight%20got%20in%20at%209%3A45%20a.m.%2C%20and%20we%20were%20heading%20straight%20to%20Porto%2C%20no%20rental%20car.%20But%20we%20were%20renting%20an%20apartment%20with%20no%20front%20desk%20and%20no%20flexibility%20on%20check-in%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20meant%20we%20were%20stuck%20carrying%20our%20luggage%20for%20hours%20before%20the%20housekeepers%20could%20store%20it%2C%20and%20we%20couldn't%20nap%20until%20nearly%20dinner.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%221447155e-e94f-4a36-90ac-e5a73e9b9c7a%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWe%20stayed%20in%20Lisbon%20too%20long%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20men%20smiling%20at%20Lisbon's%20Sao%20Jorge%20Castle%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa049999b8974787b1c9810%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWe%20enjoyed%20spending%20time%20at%20the%20S%C3%A3o%20Jorge%20Castle%2C%20but%20it%20didn't%20take%20us%20that%20long.%3Cp%3ETimothy%20Moore%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EUsually%2C%20we%20spend%20a%20couple%20of%20nights%20in%20a%20city%20and%20use%20it%20as%20a%20home%20base%20to%20visit%20nearby%20wilderness%20areas%20and%20smaller%20towns.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20the%20urging%20of%20our%20friends%20%E2%80%94%20who%20are%20big%20foodies%20and%20love%20getting%20lost%20in%20cities%20%E2%80%94%20we%20decided%20we'd%20try%20a%20more%20metropolitan-focused%20vacation%20in%20Portugal.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flisbon-first-time-mistakes-best-travel-tips-portugal-2025-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Estayed%20in%20Lisbon%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20four%20nights.%20For%20us%2C%20that%20was%20two%20nights%20too%20many.%20The%20city%20has%20plenty%20to%20offer%2C%20but%20much%20of%20our%20sightseeing%20felt%20obligatory.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20loved%20exploring%20S%C3%A3o%20Jorge%20Castle%20and%20took%20an%20amazing%20food%20tour%20in%20the%20Alfama%20neighborhood%2C%20but%20otherwise%2C%20we%20found%20Lisbon's%20streets%20were%20packed%20with%20tourists%20shuffling%20from%20one%20landmark%20to%20another.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWorse%2C%20in%20some%20crowded%20parts%20of%20town%2C%20we%20were%20regularly%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.reuters.com%2Farticle%2Fworld%2Fweeding-out-fakes-lisbon-tourism-at-threat-from-drug-dealers-idUSKBN2020DC%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eoffered%20drugs%20by%20random%20strangers%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20often%20in%20front%20of%20families%20with%20kids.%20And%20unfortunately%2C%20during%20our%20visit%2C%20many%20of%20the%20museums%20were%20closed%20for%20restoration%20%E2%80%94%20important%20work%2C%20but%20unlucky%20timing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22bdf4ccfb-6567-48e3-8dd9-7f49f7851a06%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20wish%20we'd%20spent%20more%20time%20in%20the%20Douro%20Valley%2C%20the%20Algarve%2C%20and%20nearby%20small%20towns%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225712%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Aerial%20view%20of%20greenery%2C%20water%20in%20Douro%20Valley%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa0499acc23a829a3b8ed8a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Douro%20Valley%20is%20stunning.%3Cp%3ETimothy%20Moore%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Douro%20Valley%20is%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-wine-regions-everyone-should-visit-expert-recommendations-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emost%20beautiful%20wine%20country%3C%2Fa%3E%20I've%20seen%2C%20far%20better%20than%20Napa%2C%20Tuscany%2C%20and%20Germany's%20Mosel%20Valley.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20took%20multiple%20wine%20tours%20over%20two%20days%2C%20but%20we%20barely%20scratched%20the%20surface%20of%20what%20this%20region%20has%20to%20offer.%20While%20here%2C%20we%20only%20toured%20two%20small%20towns%20%E2%80%94%20Amarante%20and%20Pinh%C3%A3o%20%E2%80%94%20but%20there%20was%20so%20much%20more%20to%20see.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20stayed%20in%20Carvoeiro%20in%20the%20Algarve%20and%20used%20it%20as%20a%20base%20for%20exploring%20nearby%20towns%2C%20a%20zoo%2C%20and%20a%20sea-kayaking%20tour%20at%20Benagil%20Beach%2C%20but%20honestly%2C%20I%20could've%20used%20another%20couple%20of%20days%20planted%20on%20the%20beach%20with%20a%20good%20book.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Lighthouse%20on%20Seven%20Hanging%20Valleys%20Trail%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa04999ec15fe2d3cf14be2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20wish%20we'd%20spent%20more%20time%20on%20the%20Seven%20Hanging%20Valleys%20Trail.%3Cp%3ETimothy%20Moore%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMost%20regrettably%2C%20we%20didn't%20dedicate%20much%20time%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-places-visit-in-portugal-tour-guide-recommendations%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehiking%20in%20Portugal%3C%2Fa%3E.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESure%2C%20we%20walked%20portions%20of%20the%20Seven%20Hanging%20Valleys%20Trail%20(a%20coastal%20hike%20along%20the%20Algarve%20coast)%2C%20but%20we%20completely%20missed%20Peneda-Ger%C3%AAs%20National%20Park%2C%20which%20offers%20amazing%20hiking%20amid%20lush%20forests%2C%20cascading%20waterfalls%2C%20and%20rolling%20mountains.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22909c5e76-42d9-430c-bdc3-e0d7cd78f0cd%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWe%20shouldn't%20have%20booked%20a%20car%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20the%20most%20part%2C%20we%20relied%20on%20public%20transportation%20in%20Portugal.%20Although%20every%20train%20we%20took%20ran%20a%20bit%20late%20and%20we%20had%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fi-tried-chauffeur-service-luxury-rental-felt-like-elon-musk-2022-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehire%20a%20private%20driver%3C%2Fa%3E%20one%20day%20because%20of%20a%20strike%2C%20I%20think%20renting%20a%20car%20is%20a%20mistake.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe'd%20booked%20a%20car%20for%20the%20final%20leg%20of%20our%20journey%2C%20the%20Algarve%2C%20so%20we%20could%20travel%20to%20all%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffavorite-us-small-towns-from-frequent-traveler-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esmall%20coastal%20towns%3C%2Fa%3E.%20But%20a%20day%20before%20we%20were%20due%20to%20pick%20it%20up%2C%20we%20canceled%20the%20reservation%20%E2%80%94%20for%20two%20reasons.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFirst%3A%20Throughout%20our%20trip%2C%20I%20saw%20firsthand%20why%20Portugal's%20considered%20among%20the%20most%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theportugalnews.com%2Fnews%2F2026-04-09%2Fportugal-is-one-of-the-most-dangerous-countries-for-driving%2F1004603%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Edangerous%20countries%20to%20drive%3C%2Fa%3E%20in.%20I've%20driven%20in%20six%20other%20European%20countries%20and%20felt%20confident%2C%20but%20watching%20the%20brazen%2C%20wild%20maneuvers%20some%20local%20drivers%20pulled%20had%20me%20thinking%20twice%20about%20getting%20behind%20the%20wheel.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESecond%3A%20Rideshares%20were%20reliable%20and%20affordable%20in%20Portugal.%20We%20saved%20money%20by%20Ubering%20around%20the%20Algarve%20instead%20of%20renting%20a%20car%20and%20paying%20for%20fuel%2C%20and%20we%20had%20no%20problems%20getting%20anywhere%20we%20wanted%20to%20go.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20is%20one%20mistake%20I'm%20glad%20we%20ultimately%20avoided%2C%20but%20it%20was%20still%20stressful%20to%20cancel%20the%20car%20and%20book%20train%20tickets%20at%20the%20last%20minute%20when%20we%20changed%20plans.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22db96c96e-0167-4c20-814a-9081b31e1731%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ESomehow%2C%20we%20made%20rookie%20packing%20mistakes%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20men%20in%20polo%20shirts%20smiling%20by%20water%20in%20Porto%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa0499a9b8974787b1c9811%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ETim%20and%20Trent%20dressed%20for%20dinner%20in%20Porto%3Cp%3ETimothy%20Moore%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20husband%20and%20I%20pride%20ourselves%20on%20our%20packing%20abilities.%20Even%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpacking-to-travel-for-a-month-cold-cities-hot-beaches-2020-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emonthlong%20trips%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20we%20don't%20check%20a%20bag.%20We%20cram%20our%20lives%20into%20two%20backpacks%20and%20two%20carry-ons%2C%20which%20makes%20train%20travel%20and%20walking%20through%20European%20streets%20easier.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20we%20made%20some%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcommon-packing-mistakes-2018-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emajor%20packing%20mistakes%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20Portugal.%20First%2C%20I%20packed%20running%20shoes%20and%20resistance%20bands%20because%20I%20planned%20to%20keep%20exercising%20on%20vacation.%20I%20didn't%20use%20them%20once.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPortugal's%20hills%20and%20our%20packed%20itinerary%20provided%20more%20than%20enough%20exercise.%20For%20the%20entire%20trip%2C%20those%20shoes%20and%20bands%20took%20up%20space%20we%20could%20have%20used%20for%20more%20clothes%20(we%20had%20to%20do%20laundry%20twice).%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20also%20forgot%20to%20pack%20American%20cold%20medicine%2C%20a%20lesson%20we%20learned%20years%20ago%20on%20our%20international%20travels%2C%20but%20completely%20forgot.%20And%20of%20course%2C%20I%20got%20sick%20near%20the%20end%20of%20the%20trip.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20got%20medicine%20from%20the%20pharmacy%2C%20but%20it%20was%20more%20expensive%20than%20American%20meds%2C%20and%2C%20in%20my%20opinion%2C%20European%20meds%20are%20often%20not%20as%20effective.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20context%2C%20the%20medication%20a%20pharmacist%20ended%20up%20selling%20me%20was%20single-ingredient%2C%20only%20targeting%20pain%20and%20fever.%20My%20go-to%20cold%20medicine%20back%20home%20is%20a%20combination%20drug%20that%20tackles%20multiple%20symptoms%2C%20including%20nasal%20congestion%2C%20cough%2C%20pain%2C%20%3Cem%3Eand%3C%2Fem%3E%20fever.%20I%20definitely%20wish%20I'd%20had%20it%20with%20me.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUnaccustomed%20to%20prioritizing%20museums%20and%20dining%20over%20hiking%2C%20we%20also%20packed%20way%20too%20many%20%26quot%3Bfancy%26quot%3B%20outfits.%20Of%20all%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmistakes-from-europe-trip-lessons-itinerary-multiple-countries-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EEuropean%20countries%20we've%20visited%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Portugal%20seemed%20to%20have%20the%20most%20laid-back%20attire%2C%20even%20at%20nice%20restaurants.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20would've%20been%20fine%20with%20a%20couple%20of%20polos%20and%20a%20pair%20of%20dressy%20shorts%20each.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22373f2ac8-cd8a-4321-9795-07f4aace0176%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EDespite%20the%20mistakes%2C%20we%20had%20a%20great%20time%20%E2%80%94%20and%20will%20course-correct%20on%20next%20year's%20trip%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Man%20with%20glass%20of%20%20wine%20in%20Douro%20Valley%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa04999ec15fe2d3cf14be3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EUltimately%2C%20Portugal%20is%20a%20beautiful%20place%20to%20visit.%3Cp%3ETimothy%20Moore%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20loved%20our%20time%20in%20Portugal.%20The%20people%20were%20so%20friendly%2C%20the%20architecture%20and%20landscapes%20were%20stunning%2C%20and%20the%20food%20was%20delicious.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20just%20needed%20to%20do%20a%20little%20more%20research%20and%20better%20planning.%20For%20our%20next%20trip%2C%20we'll%20take%20what%20we%20learned%20and%20adjust%20the%20itinerary%20to%20better%20meet%20our%20needs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmistakes-traveling-to-portugal-2-weeks-regrets-lisbon-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789229761000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa04999cc23a829a3b8ed89%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmistakes-traveling-to-portugal-2-weeks-regrets-lisbon-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22From%20spending%20too%20long%20in%20Lisbon%20to%20making%20packing%2C%20planning%2C%20and%20transportation%20mistakes%2C%20here's%20what%20I%20wish%20we%20did%20differently%20on%20our%20Portugal%20trip.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Timothy%20Moore)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22In%202001%2C%20Johnny%20Depp%20purchased%20a%2037-acre%20French%20Village%20and%20spent%20%2410M%20on%20renovations%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789229146000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-134118855%2Cimgsize-29054.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fentertainment%2Fenglish%2Fhollywood%2Fnews%2Fin-2001-johnny-depp-purchased-a-37-acre-french-village-and-spent-usd-10-million-on-renovations-to-make-swimming-pools-art-studios-and-a-pirate-themed-wine-cellar%2Farticleshow%2F134118696.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22%3Cimg%20border%3D%5C%220%5C%22%20align%3D%5C%22left%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fphoto%2F134118696.cms%5C%22%20hspace%3D%5C%2210%5C%22%3EYears%20ago%2C%20Johnny%20Depp%20made%20headlines%20by%20buying%20an%20entire%20French%20village%20in%20Plan-de-la-Tour.%20This%20ambitious%20project%20i