ert%20that%20starts%20at%208%20p.m.%20because%20they%20don't%20want%20to%20miss%20their%20kid's%20bedtime%20or%20secure%20childcare.%20That's%20just%20not%20something%20we%20let%20hold%20us%20back.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EDo%20you%20have%20a%20hot%20take%20on%20a%20common%20parenting%20belief%3F%20Email%20Jennifer%20Beck%20Goldblatt%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Ajgoldblatt%40insider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ejgoldblatt%40insider.com%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20share%20your%20experience%20with%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EWe're%20always%20open%20to%20company%2C%20but%20it's%20been%20hard%20to%20find.%20Rarely%2C%20some%20friends%20will%20also%20bring%20their%20kids%20to%20a%20fun%20late-evening%20event%2C%20but%20mostly%20we've%20just%20made%20peace%20with%20our%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Findependent-son-traveled-often-kid-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etoddler%20exploring%20the%20world%3C%2Fa%3E%20with%20us%20in%20a%20nontraditional%20manner.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d18de69c-a48a-43e0-b557-b879fcdd4587%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EOur%20toddler%20seems%20to%20like%20being%20out%20on%20the%20town%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20a%20year%20old%2C%20our%20daughter%20was%20a%20regular%20at%20our%20local%20art%20crawls%20and%20art%20museum's%20after-hours%20DJ%20parties%20and%20even%20got%20her%20first%20few%20autographs.%20She%20bops%20with%20joy%20(while%20wearing%20protective%20headphones)%20at%20almost%20every%20concert%20we%20attend%2C%20and%20still%20occasionally%20stays%20up%20past%209%20p.m.%2C%20or%20later%2C%20if%20the%20situation%20warrants%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Tyler%20Rich%20signs%20yellow%20headphones%20for%20a%20young%20fan.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa40ac5cc23a829a3b9050a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20said%20her%20daughter%20wears%20protective%20headphones%20while%20at%20loud%20concerts.%20And%20got%20her%20first%20autograph%20on%20them%20while%20seeing%20Tyler%20Rich%20perform.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Jessica%20Pate%20Thibault.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBy%20the%20time%20she%20turned%203%2C%20the%20big-name%20concerts%20that%20we%20took%20our%20daughter%20to%20included%20Tyler%20Rich%20(her%20first%20headphone%20autograph!)%2C%20Uncle%20Kracker%2C%20Keith%20Urban%20(she%20was%20up%20way%20past%2011%20p.m.%20that%20night%2C%20she%20didn't%20sleep%20like%20we%20had%20expected%20her%20to)%2C%20Dasha%2FJordan%20Davis%20(up%20way%20past%2011%20p.m.%20again)%2C%20Jelly%20Roll%2C%20and%20Gwen%20Stefani.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20third%20of%20the%20time%2C%20she%20is%20busy%20dancing%20her%20heart%20out%2C%20another%20third%20she%20is%20befriending%20whoever%20is%20behind%20us%20or%20next%20to%20us%20(or%20any%20nearby%20dogs)%2C%20and%20therest%20of%20the%20time%2C%20she%20might%20fall%20asleep%2C%20need%20a%20potty%20break%20or%20diaper%20change%2C%20want%20another%20snack%2C%20or%20get%20a%20little%20too%20antsy%20so%20we'll%20walk%20her%20around%20a%20little%20bit%20to%20reset.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENo%2C%20our%20toddler%20isn't%20invited%20to%20every%20concert%20we%20attend.%20She%20was%20not%20invited%20to%20see%20Kesha%20or%20Pitbull%20when%20I%20went%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgirls-trip-with-new-friends-travel-tips-2024-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eout%20for%20a%20girls'%20night%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Nor%20did%20she%20see%20Brooks%20%26amp%3B%20Dunn.%20For%20that%20one%2C%20we%20split%20a%20babysitter%20and%20carpooled%20with%20friends.%20But%20she%20has%20come%20to%20basically%20all%20other%20big%20evening%20events%20with%20us.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20year%2C%20our%20threenager%20has%20enjoyed%20seeing%20Jo%20Dee%20Messina%2C%20Alana%20Springsteen%2C%20Fitz%20and%20the%20Tantrums%2C%20Fake%20Happy%20(a%20Paramore%20tribute%20band)%2C%20Teddy%20Swims%2C%20and%20Miranda%20Lambert.%20Up%20next%2C%20we're%20taking%20her%20to%20see%20Brad%20Paisley.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229a43f0ac-365f-4d7c-b303-3e0196f5dd62%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EFor%20us%2C%20this%20is%20the%20logical%20choice%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20parent%20math%2C%20the%20choice%20about%20whether%20to%20bring%20my%20child%20to%20concerts%20is%20pretty%20clear.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHow%20can%20I%20accurately%20estimate%20when%20the%20openers%20will%20finish%20and%20when%20the%20main%20artist%20will%20play%3F%20It's%20hard%2C%20I've%20tried.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHow%20crazy%20will%20the%20traffic%20and%20parking%20be%20around%20the%20concert%3F%20Sometimes%20friends%20or%20prior%20experiences%20can%20help%20guesstimate%2C%20but%20that%20could%20always%20be%20wrong.%20That's%20not%20ideal%20when%20you%20have%20a%20sitter%20waiting%20back%20at%20home.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221201%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20and%20her%20partner%20with%20their%20young%20baby%20at%20an%20outdoor%20concert.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa40b4bec15fe2d3cf16387%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22901%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20said%20that%20the%20logistics%20of%20securing%20a%20sitter%20and%20communicating%20with%20them%20while%20she%20is%20at%20a%20concert%20can%20be%20complex%20and%20expensive%2C%20so%20it's%20easier%20to%20just%20bring%20her%20child.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Jessica%20Pate%20Thibault.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAlso%2C%20do%20I%20want%20to%20ask%20around%20for%20a%20babysitter%20and%20pay%20them%20%2415%20to%20%2420%2C%20or%20more%2C%20per%20hour%3F%20Do%20I%20want%20to%20go%20to%20the%20concert%20so%20badly%20that%20I'd%20add%20%24100%20or%20more%20to%20the%20cost%2C%20prepare%20the%20house%2C%20have%20backup%20plans%20for%20various%20worst-case%20scenarios%2C%20and%20make%20sure%20we're%20monitoring%20our%20phones%20constantly%20through%20(probably)%20loud%