3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221379%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20started%20emailing%20her%20son%20when%20he%20was%203.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa076d6ec15fe2d3cf14e0b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221035%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20started%20emailing%20her%20son%20when%20he%20was%203.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EI%20created%20a%20Gmail%20account%20for%20my%20oldest%20son%20when%20he%20was%203.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EFor%2015%20years%2C%20I%20emailed%20big%20milestones%20and%20tiny%20moments%20I%20didn't%20want%20to%20forget.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWhen%20he%20turned%2018%2C%20I%20gave%20him%20the%20password%20to%20his%20digital%20childhood%20archive.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20my%20eldest%20son%20was%20a%20little%20boy%2C%20I%20did%20something%20that%20felt%20quietly%20monumental%20in%20the%20moment%20and%20slightly%20ridiculous%20%E2%80%94%20I%20created%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Freference%2Fcreate-gmail-account%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGmail%20account%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20his%20name.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20was%203%20years%20old.%20Far%20too%20young%20to%20know%20what%20email%20was%2C%20let%20alone%20care%20about%20it.%20My%20BlackBerry%20(yes%2C%20I%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fblackberry-smartphone-rise-fall-mobile-failure-innovate-2019-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehad%20a%20BlackBerry%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20it%20was%202010)%20probably%20looked%20more%20like%20something%20he%20could%20play%20games%20on.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20that%20stage%20of%20life%2C%20his%20interests%20were%20vast%20but%20often%20limited%20to%20dinosaurs%2C%20Duplo%2C%20bouncy%20balls%2C%20and%20snacks.%20Lots%20of%20snacks.%20There%20was%20also%20him%20asking%20%26quot%3Bwhy%3F%26quot%3B%20approximately%20275%20times%20an%20hour.%20But%20I%20had%20the%20vague%20sense%20that%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-i-slowed-down-time-to-enjoy-my-kids-more-2022-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Echildhood%20moved%20too%20quickly%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20that%20memories%20%E2%80%94%20especially%20the%20small%20ones%20%E2%80%94%20had%20a%20way%20of%20dissolving%20if%20you%20didn't%20trap%20them%20somehow.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20also%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwoman-had-twins-at-53-says-kids-keep-her-young-2023-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Epregnant%20with%20his%20twin%20brothers%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20so%20preserving%20what%20I%20could%20of%20his%20%26quot%3Bonly%20child%26quot%3B%20status%20was%20important%20ahead%20of%20such%20a%20big%20change.%20So%20I%20opened%20the%20account%20and%20wrote%20him%20his%20first%20email.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22b684099f-98c8-455c-ae2c-d580aad1c812%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20wrote%20down%20things%20I%20didn%3C%2Fstrong%3E't%20want%20to%20forget%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20plan%20was%20simple.%20Over%20the%20years%2C%20whenever%20something%20happened%20that%20I%20didn't%20want%20to%20forget%2C%20I%20would%20write%20to%20him.%20When%20he%20turned%2018%2C%20I%20would%20hand%20over%20the%20password%20and%20let%20him%20open%20the%20whole%20archive%20at%20once.%20A%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdigital-footprint-gmail-chats-google-buzz-younger-self-nostalgia-cringe-2023-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Edigital%20time%20capsule%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20except%20instead%20of%20artifacts%2C%20it%20would%20contain%20the%20messy%2C%20funny%2C%20sentimental%20observations%20of%20a%20mother%20trying%20to%20keep%20up%20with%20a%20growing%20boy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20assumed%20I%20would%20write%20occasionally.%20It%20would%20be%20fun.%20Instead%2C%20I%20wrote%20a%20lot.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20big%20moments%20were%20easy.%20The%20first%20time%20he%20caught%20a%20ball.%20It%20was%20at%20a%20kid's%20birthday%20party%20at%20a%20sports%20gym.%20That%20earned%20a%20lengthy%20email%20complete%20with%20my%20highly%20technical%20analysis%20of%20the%20play%20(%26quot%3Byou%20ran%20very%20fast%20and%20didn't%20drop%20the%20ball%20and%20everyone%20started%20yelling!%26quot%3B).%20Birthdays%2C%20school%20milestones%2C%20and%20the%20various%20phases%20of%20childhood%20enthusiasm%20%E2%80%94%20dinosaurs%2C%20sharks%2C%20Bigfoot%2C%20Sesame%20Street%20%E2%80%94%20each%20found%20their%20way%20into%20the%20inbox.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221600%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20wanted%20to%20remember%20the%20little%20everyday%20things%20when%20her%20oldest%20son%20was%20a%20toddler.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa07818ec15fe2d3cf14e19%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221200%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20wanted%20to%20remember%20the%20little%20everyday%20things%20when%20her%20oldest%20son%20was%20a%20toddler.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20over%20time%2C%20I%20discovered%20that%20the%20emails%20I%20liked%20writing%20the%20most%20were%20about%20the%20smaller%20things.%20Sometimes%20they%20contained%20only%20a%20sentence%20or%20two.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20afternoon%2C%20I%20wrote%20about%20how%20the%20sun%20hit%20his%20hair%20as%20I%20looked%20back%20at%20him%20in%20his%20car%20seat.%20It%20caught%20the%20light%20in%20a%20way%20that%20made%20me%20stop%20where%20I%20was%2C%20in%20the%20driveway%2C%20and%20just%20look%20at%20him.%20I%20pulled%20out%20my%20phone%20and%20quickly%20wrote%20an%20email.%20It%20was%20the%20kind%20of%20moment%20that%20would%20normally%20disappear%20five%20seconds%20later%2C%20but%20writing%20it%20down%20felt%20like%20pressing%20pause.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnother%20email%20documented%20the%20day%20he%20very%20patiently%20helped%20bathe%20his%20brothers.%20I%20watched%20as%20he%20knelt%20over%20the%20tub%20with%20great%20seriousness%2C%20telling%20them%20that%20it%20was%20%26quot%3Bbath%20time%2C%26quot%3B%20repeating%20instructions%20until%20one%20of%20them%20threw%20a%20wet%20face%20cloth%20at%20his%20head.%20But%20he%20maintained%20composure%20throughout%20his%20huffing%20and%20puffing%20with%20frustration.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThose%20moments%20never%20make%20it%20into%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fgifts%2Fbest-photo-books%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ephoto%20albums%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20but%20they%20are%20the%20ones%20that%20can%20begin%20to%20define%20a%20person.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2232bbed15-816e-4e7c-8769-d9c0363a5c9a%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EIt%20became%20kind%20of%20like%20a%20journal%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOver%20the%20years%2C%20the%20emails%20piled%20up.%20Some%20were%20long%20and%20reflective.%20Others%20were%20barely%20a%20few%20sentences%20typed%20quickly%20before%20I%20forgot%20the%20moment%20that%20inspired%20them.%20Some%20included%20motherly%20advice%20that%20he%20didn't%20ask%20for.%20Sometimes%20there%20were%20stretches%20when%20I%20didn't%20write%20at%20all.%20But%20when%20I%20did%20write%2C%20the%20emails%20always%20ended%20with%20how%20much%20I%20love%20him.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20account%20became%20a%20strange%20journal.%20Except%20the%20audience%20was%20a%20future%20version%20of%20my%20son.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEvery%20so%20often%2C%20I%20would%20wonder%20what%20it%20would%20feel%20like%20when%20he%20opened%20them.%20Would%20he%20read%20them%20all%3F%20Not%20read%20any%3F%20Would%20he%20laugh%3F%20Would%20he%20be%20embarrassed%20that%20I%20kept%20calling%20him%20cute%20and%20adorable%20too%20much%20when%20he%20was%20a%20toddler%3F%20Or%20that%20I%20was%20%26quot%3Bthat%20mom%26quot%3B%20at%20a%20football%20game%20when%20he%20scored%20a%20touchdown.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%2C%20suddenly%2C%2018%20arrived.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%220991577f-416e-4b6c-950c-b768d8cd3e0e%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20gave%20him%20the%20password%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EHanding%20over%20the%20password%20felt%20weirdly%20ceremonial.%20It%20was%20the%20end%20of%20a%20project%20that%20had%20been%20quietly%20running%20in%20the%20background%20of%20our%20lives%20for%20nearly%20two%20decades.%20A%20teeny%20act%20of%20parenting%20that%20required%20no%20school%20forms%2C%20no%20carpools%2C%20sports%20equipment%2C%20or%20doctors'%20appointments%2C%20just%20the%20occasional%20email%20and%20the%20belief%20that%20someday%20it%20would%20matter.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221600%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20author%20started%20an%20email%20account%20for%20his%20twins%20also.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa0770fcc23a829a3b8efb8%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221200%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20started%20an%20email%20account%20for%20his%20twins%20also.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20the%20author%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20he%20logged%20in%20for%20the%20first%20time%2C%20he%20wasn't%20opening%20a%20typical%20inbox.%20He%20was%20opening%2018%20years%20of%20moments%20that%20might%20otherwise%20have%20vanished%3A%20graduations%20and%20birthdays%2C%20but%20also%20the%20sunlight%2C%20the%20shoelaces%2C%20and%20a%20thousand%20other%20things%20that%20seemed%20ordinary%20at%20the%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EParenthood%20has%20a%20strange%20relationship%20with%20time.%20When%20you're%20in%20the%20weeds%20of%20it%2C%20the%20days%20feel%20so%20long%20and%20chaotic.%20The%20lunches%20to%20pack%2C%20socks%20to%20match%2C%20and%20endless%20reminders%20to%20clean%20bedrooms.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20when%20you%20look%20back%2C%20it%20all%20compresses%20into%20a%20handful%20of%20flashes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20laugh%20at%20the%20dinner%20table.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20muddy%20pair%20of%20cleats.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20boy%20kneeling%20down%20to%20help%20his%20brother.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAn%20inside%20joke.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20email%20account%20turned%20those%20flashes%20into%20something%20permanent.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOnce%20I%20realized%20how%20meaningful%20it%20had%20become%2C%20I%20did%20the%20only%20logical%20thing.%20I%20created%20accounts%20for%20his%20younger%20twin%20brothers%2C%20too.%20Their%20inboxes%20are%20filling%20up%20with%20the%20same%20stories%2C%20observations%2C%20and%20evidence%20that%20wearing%20socks%20outside%20without%20shoes%20will%20cause%20holes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESomeday%2C%20they'll%20receive%20their%20passwords%20as%20well.%20And%20it%20won't%20just%20be%20opening%20emails.%20It%20will%20be%20a%20record%20of%20sorts%2C%20of%20a%20childhood%20lived%20alongside%20their%20older%20brother.%20A%20childhood%20full%20of%20shared%20kitchens%2C%20backyard%20games%2C%20and%20the%20small%20daily%20acts%20of%20kindness%20that%20siblings%20rarely%20notice%20in%20the%20moment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBy%20then%2C%20the%20house%20will%20be%20quieter%2C%20the%20bedrooms%20cleaner%2C%20and%20the%20years%20of%20noise%20and%20motion%20that%20once%20defined%20them%20as%20kids%20in%20our%20family%20will%20have%20softened%20into%20memory.%20But%20inside%20those%20Gmail%20accounts%20will%20be%20proof%20that%20time%20didn't%20simply%20rush%20past%20us%20unnoticed.%20It%20was%20captured%2C%20one%20small%20moment%20at%20a%20time%2C%20as%20they%20waited%20patiently%20for%20the%20day%20they%20would%20look%20back%20and%20see%20not%20just%20who%20they%20became%20as%20young%20men%2C%20but%20how%20deeply%20they%20were%20loved%20every%20step%20of%20the%20way.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgmail-account-son-childhood-memories-digital-time-capsule-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789220821000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa076729b8974787b1c9a2d%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgmail-account-son-childhood-memories-digital-time-capsule-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22I%20emailed%20my%20son%20memories%20of%20his%20childhood