%20was%20my%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoving-for-dream-job-was-mistake-quit-left-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Edream%20job%3C%2Fa%3E%20as%20an%20immigrant%2C%20and%20it%20was%20sustainable.%20I%20could%20have%20carried%20on%20working%20it%2C%20but%20I%20had%20also%20been%20doing%20content%20creation%20on%20the%20side%20and%20had%20just%20signed%20a%20book%20deal.%20There%20weren't%20enough%20hours%20in%20the%20day%20to%20do%20all%20three.%20It%20would%20have%20been%20like%20having%20three%20full-time%20jobs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221198%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Heigi%20Jeong%20headshot%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1a2d69b8974787b1ca254%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22899%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EHeigi%20Jeong%20was%20anxious%20about%20leaving%20her%20full%20time%20job%20and%20paycheck.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Heigi%20Jeong%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EDebating%20which%20one%20to%20let%20go%20of%2C%20I%20decided%20to%20quit%20the%20most%20stable%20of%20the%20three%20%E2%80%94%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsnap-director-product-design-ideas-degrees-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eproduct%20design%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Writing%20a%20book%20was%20very%20important%20to%20me%2C%20and%20I%20knew%20content%20creation%20would%20support%20the%20promotion%20of%20the%20book.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20I%20was%20hesitant%20to%20abandon%20my%20only%20employed%20source%20of%20work.%20The%20thought%20was%20really%20scary.%20I%20remember%20having%20so%20much%20anxiety%20in%20the%20weeks%20leading%20up%20to%20my%20resignation%20in%20June%202026.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWas%20it%20a%20mistake%20to%20leave%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgrad-student-on-budget-struggled-accept-help-gen-x-friends-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Econsistent%20paycheck%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20the%20middle%20of%20economic%20uncertainty%3F%20Would%20I%20be%20able%20to%20re-enter%20the%20market%20should%20I%20change%20my%20mind%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22fca76ead-1537-437a-b9b7-ee17e1d6697f%5C%22%3EI'm%20working%20for%20myself%20for%20a%20year%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20made%20a%20deal%20with%20myself%20to%20try%20and%20quell%20the%20anxiety%20that%20this%20was%20a%20permanent%20decision.%20For%20one%20year%2C%20I'd%20work%20for%20myself%20%E2%80%94%20pursuing%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcontent-creator-left-tech-lonely-but-worth-it-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Econtent%20creation%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20book%20writing%20%E2%80%94%20and%20then%20I'd%20decide%20if%20I%20wanted%20to%20go%20back%20to%20the%20corporate%20world.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESure%2C%20I%20might%20not%20be%20able%20to%20go%20back%20to%20the%20same%20company%20or%20make%20the%20same%20salary%20if%20I%20choose%20to%20return%2C%20but%20I%20have%20a%20r%C3%A9sum%C3%A9%20with%20lots%20of%20examples%20of%20my%20work%20should%20I%20decide%20to%20return%20to%20being%20a%20product%20designer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20resigning%2C%20every%20morning%2C%20I%20cycle%20to%20a%20gym%20and%20work%20out%2C%20and%20then%20head%20to%20an%20office%20and%20write%20from%20noon%20until%205%20p.m.%20I%20fit%20in%20content%20creation%20throughout%20the%20day.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20hoping%20to%20take%20my%20writing%20on%20the%20road%20and%20travel%20this%20year%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2295a1f397-b136-4062-96c8-43aaed369655%5C%22%3EI'm%20rushing%20less%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3ERushing%20less%2C%20I%20feel%20like%20I'm%20existing%20more%20in%20the%20world%2C%20noticing%20myself%20and%20the%20world%20around%20me%2C%20choosing%20what%20I%20want%20to%20fill%20my%20time%20with.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20had%20saved%20money%2C%20had%20a%20supportive%20partner%2C%20and%20knew%20it%20was%20possible%20on%20a%20practical%20level%20to%20give%20up%20my%20salary.%20But%20it%20hasn't%20been%20easy%20financially.%20Content%20creation%20payments%20are%20inconsistent.%20In%20July%2C%20I%20only%20made%20%246%20because%20there%20was%20a%20delay%20in%20the%20content%20creation%20payment%20system.%20I've%20had%20portions%20of%20my%20book%20advance%2C%20but%20the%20income%20from%20my%20self-employment%20fluctuates%20a%20lot.%20Some%20months%2C%20I%20earn%20zero%20dollars%20and%20other%20months%2C%20I%20earn%20even%20more%20than%20I%20used%20to%20in%20my%209%20to%205.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20had%20to%20mentally%20adapt%20to%20inconsistent%20pay%2C%20and%20rather%20than%20viewing%20it%20as%20a%20threat%2C%20seeing%20it%20as%20the%20reality%20of%20self-employment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnother%20difficulty%20has%20been%20setting%20boundaries.%20I%20could%20work%2024%20hours%20a%20day%20as%20my%20own%20boss%20because%20there%20is%20always%20more%20I%20can%20do.%20When%20I%20was%20employed%2C%20I'd%20shut%20my%20computer%20at%20the%20end%20of%20the%20day%20and%20be%20done.%20But%20being%20self-employed%2C%20my%20mind%20is%20always%20ticking%20over%20about%20work.%20I've%20had%20to%20get%20strict%20with%20myself%20to%20ensure%20I%20do%20have%20breaks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThree%20months%20in%2C%20I'm%20nearly%20always%20confident%20that%20I%20made%20the%20right%20decision%20to%20take%20this%20year%20out%2C%20though%20I%20do%20sometimes%20get%20shaken%20for%20a%20short%20time%20when%20people%20online%20tell%20me%20I've%20made%20a%20huge%20error.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20I%20hadn't%20taken%20this%20chance%20to%20pursue%20another%20dream%20of%20working%20for%20myself%2C%20I%20would%20have%20regretted%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20who%20knows%20what%20will%20come%20of%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20if%20I%20do%20return%20to%20the%20corporate%20world%2C%20this%20year%20wouldn't%20have%20been%20a%20mistake.%20I%20would%20have%20had%20the%20experience%20of%20leaving%20something%20that%20felt%20nice%20and%20stable%20for%20the%20unknown.%20That's%20a%20lesson%20I%20think%20is%20important%20to%20have%20learned.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fquit-six-figure-tech-job-self-employment-career-break-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789216321000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1934bcc23a829a3b8f5df%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fquit-six-figure-tech-job-self-employment-career-break-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Heigi%20Jeong%20quit%20a%20%24173%2C000%20tech%20job%20with%20good%20work-life%20balance%20to%20write%20a%20book%20and%20create%20content.%20She's%20giving%20self-employment%20one%20year.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Lauren%20Crosby%20Medlicott)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22My%20family%20of%204%20visits%20the%20same%20vacation%20spot%20multiple%20times%20a%20year.%20I%20hope%20my%20kids%20look%20back%20on%20it%20fondly.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221700%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22the%20author's%20family%20hiking%20on%20a%20river%20in%20the%20Catskills%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2b9ca9b8974787b1ca6d0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221134%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20and%20her%20family%20vacation%20in%20the%20Catskills%20multiple%20times%20a%20year.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Lindsay%20Karp%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EWhen%20I%20was%20young%2C%20my%20family%20used%20to%20go%20to%20the%20Jersey%20Shore.%20I%20look%20back%20on%20those%20trips%20fondly.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAfter%20becoming%20parents%2C%20my%20husband%20and%20I%20started%20our%20own%20family%20tradition.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWe%20found%20a%20vacation%20spot%20that's%20perfect%20for%20our%20family.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20was%20a%20child%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fantarctica-travel-with-kids-teens-bucket-list-family-trip-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ethe%20Jersey%20Shore%3C%2Fa%3E%20was%20my%20magical%20place.%20My%20great-grandmother%2C%20her%20siblings%2C%20and%20a%20few%20other%20relatives%20lived%20there%20in%20a%20high-rise%20apartment%20building%2C%20so%20every%20summer%20we'd%20visit%20for%20a%20week.%20Looking%20out%20from%20the%20balcony%2C%20I%20believed%20the%20ocean%20went%20on%20forever.%20On%20the%20bottom%20floor%2C%20the%20community%20pool%20brought%20children%20together%20in%20carefree%2C%20summer%20bliss.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20the%20beach%2C%20my%20brother%20and%20I%20used%20our%20boogie%20boards%20like%2016-year-olds%20with%20fresh%20permits%2C%20owning%20the%20waves%20until%20sunset.%20I%20built%20sandcastles%20while%20he%20dug%20a%20never-ending%20hole%20to%20China%2C%20and%20we%20devoured%20peanut%20butter%20and%20jelly%20sandwiches%20that%20somehow%20tasted%20superior%20in%20the%20salty%20air.%20At%20night%2C%20the%20boardwalk%20signs%20lit%20up%20the%20sky%2C%20and%20Kohr%20Bros%20soft%20serve%20always%20hit%20the%20spot.%20As%20a%20kid%2C%20there%20was%20nowhere%20else%20I'd%20rather%20be.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d9a59e7b-5942-4b07-8028-ca58849b89e3%5C%22%3EWhen%20we%20became%20parents%2C%20we%20started%20taking%20our%20own%20summer%20trips%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20our%20kids%20were%20born%2C%20my%20husband%20and%20I%20started%20a%20Jersey%20Shore%20tradition%20of%20our%20own.%20We%20filled%20our%20SUV%20with%20duffel%20bags%2C%20sand%20buckets%2C%20and%20shovels%2C%20and%20every%20gadget%20needed%20to%20take%20toddlers%20away.%20Our%20boys%20enjoyed%20the%20beach%20%E2%80%94%20and%20it%20triggered%20a%20sweet%20nostalgia%20for%20me%20%E2%80%94%20but%20hauling%20the%20kids%20and%20all%20the%20gear%20across%20the%20sand%20was%20tiring%2C%20only%20for%20the%20sun%20to%20wear%20them%20out%20quickly%2C%20and%20the%20heat%20weakened%20my%20body%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnot-fun-mom-multiple-sclerosis-husband-steps-in-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emultiple%20sclerosis%3C%2Fa%3E%20(MS).%20After%20eight%20years%20of%20annual%20beach%20getaways%20%E2%80%94%20when%20my%20boys%20were%209%20and%206%20%E2%80%94%20we%20switched%20gears%20completely.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20husband%20is%20an%20avid%20hiker%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fchronic-illness-resume-helped-me-get-better-healthcare-2023-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eliving%20with%20chronic%20illness%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20I%20yearned%20to%20get%20away%20from%20the%20hustle%20and%20bustle.%20A%20higher%20elevation%20provides%20a%20drier%2C%20cooler%20atmosphere%2C%20which%20helps%20keep%20my%20symptoms%20at%20bay.%20So%2C%20our%20summer%20family%20vacation%20shifted%20to%20the%20Catskill%20Mountains.%20Only%20a%20three-hour%20drive%20from%20our%20home%2C%20it%20was%20equally%20as%20accessible%20as%20the%20beach.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%225284c6d9-8c6b-43c3-b817-81a4389d2a3b%5C%22%3EWe%20found%20a%20place%20to%20go%20that%20works%20for%20our%20family%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EFrom%20the%20moment%20we%20arrived%20for%20our%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffavorite-us-cities-towns-to-visit-summer-frequent-traveler-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Efirst%20trip%20in%20the%20summer%3C%2Fa%3E%20of%202020%2C%20I%20felt%20like%20we%20were%20at%20our%20second%20home.%20It%20was%20a%20great%20place%20to%20spend%20some%20of%20those%20early%20pandemic%20months%2C%20offering%20a%20beautiful%20change%20of%20scenery%20while%20also%20allowing%20us%20to%20keep%20our%20distance%20from%20others.%20We%20thought%20it%20was%20the%20perfect%20COVID-era%20getaway%2C%20but%20the%20instant%20we%20returned%20home%2C%20we%20couldn't%20wait%20to%20go%20back.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe've%20returned%20to%20the%20Catskills%20multiple%20times%20a%20year%20since%20then%20%E2%80%94%20and%20during%20every%20season.%20Our%20visits%20always%20include%20biking%20along%20the%20Ashokan%20Reservoir%2C%20swimming%20in%20Peekamoose%20Blue%20Hole%2C%20a%20natural%20swimming%20hole%20in%20the%20Sundown%20Wild%20Forest%2C%20and%20eating%20at%20our%20favorite%20spot%2C%20Yum%20Yum%20Noodle%20Bar.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20peruse%20the%20shops%20in%20Woodstock%2C%20New%20York%2C%20and%20my%20kids%20enjoy%20ice%20cream%20from%20their%20favorite%20creamery%2C%20Sweet%20Dreams.%20In%20October%2C%20we%20head%20to%20the%20Bethel%20Woods%20Center%20for%20the%20Arts%20%E2%80%94%20the%20location%20of%20Woodstock%20in%201969%20%E2%80%94%20for%20their%20annual%20Peace%2C%20Love%2C%20and%20Pumpkins%20festival%20featuring%20thousands%20of%20hand-carved%20jack-o'-lanterns.%20While%20my%20husband%20takes%20the%20boys%20hiking%2C%20I%20rest%20in%20a%20peaceful%20atmosphere%20that%20provides%20a%20calmness%20I%20never%20found%20at%20the%20beach.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221432%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22the%20author's%20family%20hiking%20in%20the%20Catskills%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2b947cc23a829a3b8fc21%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221909%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Catskills%20offer%20opportunities%20for%20hiking%20as%20well%20as%20a%20peaceful%20atmosphere.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Lindsay%20Karp%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22db5773b0-fe69-47c0-b95e-21d865a0bead%5C%22%3EI%20hope%20my%20kids%20look%20back%20on%20these%20trips%20fondly%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Jersey%20Shore%20will%20always%20remind%20me%20of%20my%20carefree%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmom-brings-back-nineties-summers-no-technology-structure-2024-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esummer%20days%20in%20the%2090s%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20I%20have%20no%20doubt%20my%20family%20will%20enjoy%20a%20beach%20getaway%20again.%20But%20now%2C%20my%20kids%20have%20their%20magical%20place%2C%20too.%20As%20adults%2C%20when%20they%20think%20of%20their%20childhood%2C%20they'll%20recall%20the%20pools%20at%20our%20Airbnbs%20where%20we%20swam%20beneath%20the%20orange%20sunset.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThey'll%20remember%20our%20favorite%20bike%20path%20with%20views%20of%20the%20reservoir%2C%20and%20they'll%20reminisce%20about%20winter%20days%20hiking%20through%20the%20snow.%20I%20bet%20they'll%20almost%20taste%20the%20sweetness%20of%20a%20roasted%20marshmallow%20when%20they%20recall%20our%20time%20around%20the%20fire%20pit%20in%20the%20crisp%20October%20air.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20hope%20their%20magical%20place%20feels%20as%20wondrous%20and%20perfect%20as%20the%20beach%20always%20will%20to%20me.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffamily-visits-same-vacation-spot-multiple-times-year-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789215541000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa2b9d4ec15fe2d3cf15a6c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffamily-visits-same-vacation-spot-multiple-times-year-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22As%20a%20family%2C%20we%20visit%20the%20same%20vacation%20spot%20multiple%20times%20a%20year.%20I%20hope%20my%20two%20kids%20look%20back%20on%20our%20trips%20to%20the%20Catskills%20fondly.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Lindsay%20Karp)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Who%20is%20Suhas%3F%20Meet%20the%20Telugu%20actor%20winning%20praise%20for%20his%20role%20in%20'Mandaadi'%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789215467000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-134130960%2Cimgsize-170282.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fentertainment%2Ftamil%2Fmovies%2Fnews%2Fwho-is-suhas-meet-the-telugu-actor-winning-praise-for-his-standout-ne