%20core%20investment%20company%20category%2C%20making%20a%20public%20listing%20mandatory%20amid%20leadership%20turbulence%20at%20the%20group%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22I%20let%20my%2015-year-old%20fly%20home%20alone%20from%20Europe.%20It%20didn't%20go%20smoothly%2C%20but%20I'm%20still%20glad%20she%20earned%20the%20independence.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221709%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20visitors%20pose%20for%20a%20selfie%20inside%20an%20ornate%20marble%20hall%20beneath%20a%20red%20banner%20with%20the%20Spanish%20coat%20of%20arms.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa19178cc23a829a3b8f5a7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221282%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20(right)%20allowed%20her%20teenage%20daughter%20to%20fly%20home%20from%20Spain%20by%20herself.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Jamie%20Davis%20Smith%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EWhen%20I%20booked%20an%20extended-family%20trip%20to%20Europe%2C%20my%20teenage%20daughter%20complained%20it%20was%20too%20long.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EI%20agreed%20to%20let%20her%20fly%20home%20early%20by%20herself%2C%20even%20though%20I%20was%20nervous%20and%20reluctant.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EShe%20forgot%20her%20passport%20and%20faced%20delays%2C%20but%20she%20got%20home%20safely.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EMost%20summers%2C%20I%20try%20to%20pack%20in%20as%20much%20travel%20as%20possible%20with%20my%20kids.%20My%20children%20have%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmom-lists-the-benefits-of-giving-her-kids-dual-citizenship-2022-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Edual%20citizenship%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20it's%20important%20to%20me%20that%20they%20spend%20time%20in%20Europe%20and%20connect%20with%20their%20roots.%20I%20enjoy%20showing%20them%20the%20rest%20of%20the%20world%2C%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20past%20years%2C%20my%20kids%20have%20had%20fun%20traveling%20from%20Rome%20to%20Warsaw%20or%20Seoul%20to%20Tokyo.%20This%20summer%2C%20I%20planned%20on%20staying%20in%20Europe%20for%20nearly%20a%20month%2C%20making%20the%20most%20of%20our%20time%20by%20staying%20until%20the%20day%20before%20school%20started.%20I%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-travel-tips-from-world-traveler-advice-2019-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebooked%20hotels%20and%20flights%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20excitedly%20told%20my%20kids%20the%20plan.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20this%20year%20went%20a%20bit%20differently%20than%20expected.%20I%20allowed%20my%20teenage%20daughter%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flived-off-the-grid-biggest-challenges-inconveniences-surprises-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etravel%20home%3C%2Fa%3E%20alone.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%228d2eda98-f8e1-4ada-b2d2-a17b655077ed%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EMy%20daughter%20wasn't%20happy%20when%20she%20heard%20about%20my%20extended%20travel%20plans%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20my%2011-year-old%20son%20learned%20we%20would%20be%20spending%20nearly%20a%20month%20in%20Europe%2C%20he%20was%20overjoyed.%20My%2015-year-old%20daughter%2C%20however%2C%20was%20despondent.%20She%20wanted%20to%20spend%20time%20with%20her%20friends.%20Plus%2C%20she%20worried%20about%20meeting%20her%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2F3-experts-share-how-parents-can-budget-this-school-year-2023-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eschool%20obligations%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20include%20a%20leadership%20position%20in%20a%20school%20club%20and%20cross-country%20and%20track%20training.%20She%20begged%20me%20to%20cut%20the%20trip%20short.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20I%20wasn't%20willing%20to%20end%20my%20trip%20early.%20I%20had%20hard-to-get%20tickets%20to%20a%20Real%20Madrid%20soccer%20match%20for%20the%20last%20day%20of%20the%20trip.%20My%20son%20and%20I%20are%20both%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Folder-parent-splurging-to-make-memories-with-child-world-cup-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehuge%20soccer%20fans%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20I%20didn't%20want%20to%20miss%20the%20game.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDesperate%2C%20my%20daughter%20started%20listing%20the%20meetings%20and%20practices%20she%20would%20miss%20if%20we%20stayed%20in%20Europe%20until%20just%20before%20school%20began.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%224dfe4f1a-fb98-44d3-8c5a-d2766f7e6b32%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EMy%20daughter%20asked%20if%20she%20could%20fly%20home%20alone%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EUnwilling%20to%20accept%20no%20for%20an%20answer%2C%20my%20daughter%20sprang%20into%20action.%20She%20didn't%20whine%20and%20complain.%20Instead%2C%20she%20researched%20whether%20she%20could%20fly%20home%20alone%20and%20presented%20me%20with%20the%20facts.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20showed%20me%20that%20I%20could%20change%20her%20flight%2C%20booked%20with%20points%2C%20at%20no%20extra%20cost.%20She%20presented%20airline%20policies%20indicating%20that%20she%20was%20old%20enough%20to%20fly%20alone%20without%20paying%20an%20unaccompanied%20minor%20fee%2C%20and%20that%20there%20were%20no%20restrictions%20on%20American%20minors%20flying%20alone%20from%20Spain%20to%20the%20US.%20She%20also%20found%20a%20direct%20flight%20from%20Madrid%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-to-washington-dc-left-philadelphia-things-miss-about-home-2025-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EWashington%2C%20DC%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20greatly%20reduced%20the%20chances%20of%20something%20going%20wrong.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20daughter%20made%20a%20convincing%20case%2C%20and%20I%20reluctantly%20agreed.%20I%20tried%20to%20think%20of%20everything%20that%20could%20go%20wrong.%20I%20signed%20a%20letter%20giving%20her%20permission%20to%20travel%20solo%20and%20had%20it%20notarized.%20I%20made%20sure%20she%20had%20a%20phone%2C%20credit%20card%2C%20and%20cash%20in%20case%20she%20needed%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENevertheless%2C%20I%20was%20still%20reluctant%20and%20didn't%20fully%20commit%20to%20the%20plan%20until%20the%20night%20before%20her%20flight.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20told%20my%20daughter%20that%20I%20wanted%20her%20to%20stay%2C%20but%20if%20she%20left%20early%2C%20she%20was%20responsible%20for%20packing%2C%20getting%20up%20on%20time%2C%20and%20making%20sure%20she%20had%20everything%20she%20needed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2243d3d7a0-3283-41c7-b6aa-0026ce64a8fc%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EEven%20with%20preparation%2C%20things%20didn't%20go%20entirely%20smoothly%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20I%20wasn't%20fully%20behind%20my%20daughter's%20plans%20to%20leave%20our%20family%20vacation%20early%2C%20I%20told%20her%20I%20would%20accompany%20her%20to%20the%20airport%20in%20case%20she%20ran%20into%20any%20problems%20or%20changed%20her%20mind.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDespite%20all%20of%20my%20planning%2C%20things%20didn't%20go%20entirely%20smoothly.%20I%20had%20suggested%20leaving%20our%20hotel%20well%20before%20flight%20departure%20time%20in%20case%20she%20ran%20into%20any%20issues%20leaving%20the%20country%20as%20a%20solo%2015-year-old%20traveler.%20She%20disagreed%20with%20my%20timeframe%2C%20preferring%20to%20get%20a%20little%20more%20sleep%20and%20enjoy%20the%20hotel's%20buffet.%20I%20was%20a%20little%20concerned%2C%20but%20I%20deferred%20to%20her%20judgment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20she%20was%20ready%2C%20we%20hopped%20into%20a%20taxi.%20However%2C%20halfway%20to%20the%20airport%2C%20my%20daughter%20realized%20she%20had%20forgotten%20her%20passport%20at%20the%20hotel.%20I%20explained%20the%20situation%20to%20our%20driver%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famerican-retired-early-abroad-mexico-mistakes-made-first-year-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebroken%20Spanish%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20he%20drove%20like%20a%20madman%20to%20rush%20us%20back.%20When%20we%20arrived%20at%20the%20airport%2C%20frazzled%20and%20rushed%2C%20I%20had%20to%20quickly%20kiss%20my%20daughter%20on%20the%20cheek%20and%20wish%20her%20a%20good%20flight.%20I%20waited%20until%20she%20texted%20me%20that%20she%20was%20through%20before%20heading%20back%20into%20the%20city%2C%20even%20though%20a%20piece%20of%20my%20heart%20was%20about%20to%20fly%20across%20the%20Atlantic%20without%20me.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20expected%20to%20hear%20from%20my%20daughter%20next%20when%20she%20landed.%20However%2C%20I%20received%20regular%20updates%20over%20the%20next%20two%20hours.%20She%20was%20stuck%20on%20the%20tarmac%20because%20of%20the%20weather%2C%20bored%20and%20unsure%20whether%20her%20flight%20would%20ever%20take%20off.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BYou%20can%20always%20come%20back%20to%20the%20hotel%2C%26quot%3B%20I%20reminded%20her%2C%20but%20she%20ignored%20me.%20Her%20flight%20finally%20took%20off%2C%20but%20midway%20through%2C%20the%20passenger%20next%20to%20her%20stepped%20on%20her%20headphones%2C%20so%20she%20couldn't%20watch%20movies%20or%20listen%20to%20music%20for%20the%20last%20half%20of%20her%20long%20journey%20across%20the%20ocean.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22cce9b651-fd0e-4567-8217-8141bad2d8d8%5C%22%3EBut%20she%20made%20it%20home%20safely%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20daughter%20enjoyed%20the%20rest%20of%20her%20summer%20the%20way%20she%20wanted%20to.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20glad%20I%20let%20her%20take%20this%20huge%20leap%20toward%20independence.%20Although%20it's%20sometimes%20hard%20for%20me%20to%20accept%20that%20my%20little%20girl%20is%20growing%20up%2C%20I%20knew%20she%20was%20ready%20to%20decide%20when%20it%20was%20time%20to%20leave%20and%20travel%20halfway%20across%20the%20world%20on%20her%20own.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELeaving%20her%20at%20the%20airport%20was%20just%20one%20of%20many%20goodbyes%20I%20know%20are%20coming%20as%20she%20gets%20older%20and%20creates%20her%20own%20life.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20glad%20I%20gave%20her%20the%20opportunity%20to%20prove%20that%20she%20is%20ready.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmom-let-teenage-daughter-fly-home-alone-europe-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789213621000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa19184ec15fe2d3cf15415%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmom-let-teenage-daughter-fly-home-alone-europe-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22I%20booked%20an%20extended%20family%20trip%20to%20Spain%2C%20but%20my%20teenage%20daughter%20complained%20it%20was%20too%20long.%20I%20reluctantly%20agreed%20to%20let%20her%20fly%20home%20alone.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Jamie%20Davis%20Smith)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Moving%20from%20New%20York%20to%20Kentucky%20gave%20me%20an%20affordable%20life%20I%20love%20%E2%80%94%20and%20retiring%20at%2055%20is%20now%20on%20the%20table%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221537%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20smiling%20adults%20sit%20in%20a%20grassy%20field%20holding%20two%20dogs%2C%20with%20a%20blurred%20city%20skyline%20in%20the%20background.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1bf85cc23a829a3b8f93c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222306%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ENick%20Lyktey%20went%20to%20Kentucky%20to%20fulfill%20a%20one-year%20working%20requirement%2C%20and%20stayed%20years%20later.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Nick%20Lyktey%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ENew%20Yorker%20Nick%20Lyktey%20moved%20to%20Kentucky%20for%20work%2C%20thinking%20he'd%20only%20be%20there%20for%20one%20year.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHe%20ended%20up%20falling%20in%20love%20with%20Fort%20Wright%2C%20Kentucky%2C%20a%20suburb%20five%20miles%20outside%20Cincinnati.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHe%20says%20the%20state's%20relative