get%20placed%20somewhere%20else.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2248d8f289-5b5e-4f15-8ad7-77c355ef0d23%5C%22%3EMy%20area%20of%20Kentucky%20is%20more%20suburban%20and%20less%20rural%20than%20I%20expected%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmove-los-angeles-kentucky-near-family-husband-didnt-agree-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EI%20didn't%20think%20Kentucky%3C%2Fa%3E%20was%20going%20to%20be%20as%20urban%20or%20suburban%20as%20it%20ended%20up%20being.%20I%20thought%20it%20was%20going%20to%20be%20a%20little%20bit%20more%20rural%2C%20with%20maybe%20not%20as%20much%20access%20to%20things.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20was%20telling%20my%20family%20about%20the%20move%2C%20my%20mom%2C%20who%20was%20born%20and%20raised%20on%20Long%20Island%2C%20would%20always%20make%20jokes%20to%20me.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20would%20be%20like%2C%20%26quot%3BYou're%20going%20to%20get%20a%20pickup%20truck%2C%26quot%3B%20or%20%26quot%3BIt's%20probably%20just%20a%20bunch%20of%20farms.%26quot%3B%20I%20was%20like%2C%20%26quot%3BNo%2C%20no%2C%20it's%20pretty%20built%20up.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20expectations%20were%20that%20Fort%20Wright%20was%20going%20to%20be%20a%20smaller%2C%20less%20populated%20city%3B%20if%20I%20live%20in%20Kentucky%2C%20I'm%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-things-to-do-cincinnati-ohio-according-to-local-2021-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Egoing%20to%20go%20to%20Cincinnati%3C%2Fa%3E%20all%20the%20time.%20That%20was%20the%20energy%20I%20had%2C%20but%20I%20was%20looking%20at%20it%20as%20more%20of%20a%20short-term%20scope.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20I%20moved%20in%2C%20when%20my%20mom%20visited%20me%2C%20she%20would%20always%20say%2C%20%26quot%3BThis%20is%20a%20little%20paradise.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221102%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Three%20fans%20in%20Reds%20jerseys%20pose%20at%20a%20rainy%20baseball%20stadium%20concourse%20beneath%20live%20radar%20weather%