to%20get%20the%20best%20things%20for%20my%20daughter.%20That%20matters%20the%20most%20to%20me%20in%20the%20world.%20Having%20that%20financial%20flexibility%20is%20really%20powerful.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20have%20a%20bunch%20of%20friends%20who%20we're%20all%20in%20the%20same%20stage%20of%20life%20together.%20A%20lot%20of%20them%20still%20live%20on%20Long%20Island%20and%20they're%20buying%20houses%20and%20having%20kids.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20talk%20about%20these%20financial%20things%20and%20I%20realized%20we%20live%20in%20radically%20different%20worlds.My%20wife%20and%20I%20were%20able%20to%20get%20a%20pretty%20nice%20starter%20family%20home%20with%20a%20fenced-in%20backyard.%20We%20have%20two%20dogs%20and%20we%20have%20one%20daughter%2C%20and%20I%20think%20it's%20a%20comfortable%20way%20of%20living%20where%20our%20mortgage%20isn't%20suffocating.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221536%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20adults%20stand%20on%20a%20brick%20home's%20front%20porch%20holding%20a%20swaddled%20baby%20in%20black%20and%20white.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1bf859b8974787b1ca3c7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222304%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELyktey%20in%20front%20of%20his%20home%20with%20his%20wife%20and%20his%20daughter.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Nick%20Lyktey%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20of%20my%20buddies%20on%20Long%20Island%20bought%20a%20house%20that%20was%20listed%20at%20%24650%2C000%20and%20they%20closed%20at%20%24750%2C000%20%E2%80%94%20and%20it's%20a%20fixer-upper.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20house%20was%20%24230%2C000%2C%20and%20it%20was%20ready%20to%20go%20in%20a%20nice%20suburb%20close%20to%20work.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20love%20where%20I%20grew%20up%20and%20I%20have%20no%20issues%20there%2C%20but%20we%20have%20a%20lot%20more%20financial%20flexibility%20and%20can%20do%20a%20lot%20more%20here.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20like%20a%20chemical%20shift%20in%20your%20brain%20because%20I%20never%20grew%20up%20in%20that%20type