d83ffdd2%5C%22%3EWhat's%20new%20in%20the%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20and%2018%20Pro%20Max%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20someone%20who%20has%20been%20covering%20new%20smartphone%20releases%20for%20years%2C%20I%20can%20say%20that%20recent%20releases%20have%20been%20somewhat%20boring.%20The%20same%20cannot%20be%20said%20for%20the%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20lineup.%20Here's%20a%20quick%20list%20of%20what's%20new%20with%20the%20latest%20iPhones%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3E48MP%20Fusion%20Main%20camera%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3A%20For%20the%20first%20time%2C%20the%20iPhone%20camera%20offers%20aperture%20control%20for%20more%20control%20over%20your%20photo's%20depth%20and%20lighting.%20This%2C%20plus%20a%20new%20sensor%20for%20better%20image%20quality%2C%20means%20crisper%20details%20and%20better%20low-light%20pictures.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EAdditions%20to%20the%20photo%20editing%20suite%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3A%20The%20Apple%20collection%20of%20Photographic%20Styles%20has%20been%20upgraded%2C%20giving%20the%20ability%20to%20tweak%20texture%20and%20grain%20controls.%20Cinematic%20effects%20can%20also%20be%20applied%20to%20videos%20shot%20at%20up%20to%2060%20frames%20per%20second%2C%20and%20Time-lapse%20mode%20can%20now%20record%20in%204K%20and%20Dolby%20Vision%20HDR.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EApple%20Reference%20Image%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3A%20Thanks%20to%20the%20camera's%20new%20sensor%2C%20photos%20taken%20with%20the%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20can%20now%20be%20authenticated%20when%20captured%20in%20the%20new%20Reference%20mode.%20In%20short%2C%20the%20pictures%20you%20take%20will%20be%20verifiably%20real%2C%20and%20not%20AI.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EDynamic%20Island%20upgrades%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3A%20Redesigned%20to%20fit%20more%20information%20than%20before%2C%20the%20Dynamic%20Island%20(or%20the%20black%20oval%20that%20lives%20around%20the%20selfie%20camera)%20can%20now%20track%20up%20to%20three%20Live%20Activities%20simultaneously.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EA20%20Pro-powered%20performance%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3A%20Now%20with%2050%25%20more%20memory%20bandwidth%20and%2040%25%20faster%20GPU%20design%20than%20its%20predecessor%2C%20the%20A20%20chip%20in%20the%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20enables%20faster%20graphics%20rendering%2C%20more%20powerful%20on-device%20AI%20processing%2C%20and%20more.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ENew%20cooling%20and%20interior%20architecture%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3A%20Aimed%20at%20eliminating%20overheating%20issues%20of%20past%20iPhones%2C%20the%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20features%20a%20redesigned%20vapor%20chamber%20and%20reorganized%20interior%20hardware%20to%20keep%20key%20components%20cooler%20for%20faster%20performance.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EUnprecedented%20battery%20life%20and%20charging%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3A%20eSIM-only%20iPhone%2018%20Pros%20can%20now%20deliver%20up%20to%2036%20hours%20of%20video%20playback%2C%20while%20the%20Pro%20Max%20can%20reach%20up%20to%2045%20hours.%20Not%20only%20that%2C%20but%20the%20Pro%20can%20charge%20to%2050%25%20battery%20in%2015%20minutes%20when%20plugged%20in%2C%20or%20in%2030%20minutes%20when%20charging%20wirelessly.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2220b81264-3b06-43b1-9e25-74f1455c8077%5C%22%3EWhen%20will%20the%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20release%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThough%20it%20will%20open%20for%20preorders%20starting%20on%20September%2012%2C%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20models%20won't%20be%20available%20in%20shoppers'%20hands%20until%20September%2018.%20Fulfillment%20dates%20will%20also%20be%20pushed%20out%20as%20stock%20dwindles%2C%20so%20your%20order%20may%20not%20arrive%20until%20after%20that%20date%20if%20you%20order%20late.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%225f2d3f82-bcab-4136-86df-0662ebc2cf3c%5C%22%3EWhen%20will%20the%20iPhone%20Duo%20release%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20was%20announced%20in%20the%20same%20keynote%2C%20but%20Apple%20will%20not%20be%20releasing%20the%20iPhone%20Duo%20for%20some%20time.%20The%20new%20foldable%20will%20be%20up%20for%20preorder%20starting%20October%2016%2C%2