ded%20to%20help%20your%20body%20temperature%20drop%20so%20you%20can%20fall%20asleep.%20The%20overall%20sensation%20eventually%20dissipates%20as%20the%20bed%E2%80%99s%20surface%20absorbs%20more%20of%20your%20heat.%20Passive%20cooling%20materials%20are%20what%E2%80%99s%20most%20commonly%20used%20on%20mattresses%2C%20and%20take%20a%20variety%20of%20forms.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPhase%20change%20material%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20This%20material%20absorbs%20heat%20and%20releases%20it%20as%20a%20cool-to-the-touch%20sensation.%20The%20science%20behind%20it%20involves%20turning%20PCM%20particulates%20into%20substances%20that%20can%20melt%2C%20like%20a%20gel%2C%20from%20solid%20to%20liquid.%20In%20other%20words%2C%20microencapsulated%20PCM%20is%20woven%20into%20fabric%20like%20cooling%20covers%20or%20infused%20into%20memory%20foam%2C%20and%20will%20liquefy%20when%20coming%20into%20contact%20with%20body%20heat.%20This%20change%20triggers%20a%20cooling%20sensation%2C%20but%20it%20usually%20hits%20a%20threshold%20once%20an%20area%20has%20reached%20its%20maximum%20cooling%20effect%2C%20making%20it%20feel%20more%20like%20room%20temperature.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPolyethylene%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20This%20fiber%20is%20a%20high-thermal-conductivity%20material%2C%20meaning%20that%20it%20pulls%20in%20heat%20like%20a%20magnet%20and%20spreads%20it%20out%20so%20it%E2%80%99s%20not%20concentrated%20around%20you.%20In%20doing%20so%2C%20it%20gives%20off%20the%20impression%20of%20cooling.%20Find%20it%20in%20the%20Brooklyn%20Aurora%20Luxe%20Cooling%20hybrid%E2%80%99s%20proprietary%20%E2%80%9CGlacioTex%E2%80%9D%20fabric%2C%20a%20blend%20of%20polyester%20and%20polyethylene.%20Bedgear%20also%20uses%20this%20fiber%20in%20its%20proprietary%20Ver-Tex%20cooling%20cover.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ECelliant%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThis%20cooling%20material%20uses%20bioceramic%20minerals%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fcelliant.com%2Ftechnology%2Fhow-it-works%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eengineered%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20absorb%20heat%20and%20transform%20it%20into%20infrared%20light.%20The%20idea%20is%20that%20this%20infrared%20energy%20has%20restorative%20properties%20for%20the%20body%20and%20boosts%20overall%20circulation%2C%20but%20just%20feels%20cool%20to%20the%20touch%20while%20doing%20so.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ECopper%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThis%20is%20most%20commonly%20infused%20into%20memory%20foam%20layers.%20Copper%20is%20a%20natural%20thermal%20conductor%2C%20meaning%20it%20pulls%20in%20body%20heat%20to%20direct%20it%20away%20from%20you.%20It%20has%20the%20added%20benefit%20of%20preventing%20bacteria%20buildup.%20Copper%20is%20a%20naturally%20antimicrobial%20material%2C%20which%20is%20useful%20for%20long-term%20material%20integrity.%20However%2C%20a%20higher%20number%20of%20copper%20particles%20in%20the%20foam%20provides%20better%20cooling%20and%20germ%20prevention.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EGraphite%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Like%20copper%2C%20this%20mineral%20is%20also%20classified%20as%20a%20natural%20thermal%20conductor%2C%20able%20to%20distribute%20heat%20across%20a%20mattress's%20surface%20and%20dissipate%20it%2C%20rather%20than%20letting%20it%20build%20up%20around%20you.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EActive%20Cooling%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EActive%20cooling%20maintains%20a%20consistent%20temperature%20throughout%20the%20night%2C%20so%20the%20cooling%20sensation%20never%20fades.%20For%20advanced%20cases%20of%20night%20sweats%20and%20overheating%2C%20this%20can%20be%20an%20invaluable%20tool%20for%20some.%20%3Cstrong%3EWater%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20is%20a%20leading%20thermoregulating%20agent%2C%20as%20it%20absorbs%20body%20heat%20when%20it%E2%80%99s%20pumped%20into%20a%20cooling%20topper%20and%20then%20carries%20it%20away%20from%20you.%20%3Cstrong%3EAir%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20is%20another%2C%20as%20many%20turn%20to%20fan-based%20systems%20like%20BedJet%20for%20consistent%20surface%20temperature%20control.%20Active%20cooling%20requires%20separate%20add-on%20toppers%20or%20external%20units%20rather%20than%20built-in%20mattress%20layers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22cb803823-898f-4d8a-a30a-8e6d207e98c2%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20overall%5C%22%3EBest%20overall%3C%2Fh2%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%20makes%20it%20cooling%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EFeatures%20a%20GlacioTex%E2%84%A2%20cool-touch%20cover%2C%20heat-absorbing%20copper%20foam%2C%20PCM%20pillowtop%2C%20and%20airflow-promoting%20pocketed%20coils.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EBuilt%20to%20keep%20you%20cool%20all%20night%20long.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3Da810de2f356fe062bc51e3bcb7563eaeeca5662d1ae843df174718043cd1ad9e%26postID%3D6aa32106d49152a6be8fbfc1%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-cooling-mattresses%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fbrooklynbedding.com%252Fproducts%252Faurora%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBrooklyn%20Bedding%20Aurora%20Luxe%20Cooling%3C%2Fa%3E%20first%20hit%20the%20market%20in%202017%2C%20and%20since%20then%20has%20been%20a%20longstanding%20crowd%20favorite%20because%20of%20its%20cooling%20capabilities%E2%80%94and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbrooklyn-bedding-aurora-mattress-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eone%20of%20ours%3C%2Fa%3E.%20The%C2%A0%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D8ce72985ddf81c30fc6af4d882d2817eb9dc5963864b1b2085d44fb951e1e76c%26postID%3D6aa32106d49152a6be8fbfc1%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-cooling-mattresses%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fbrooklynbedding.com%252Fblogs%252Fmain%252Four-cool-approach-to-sleep%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGlacioTex%3C%2Fa%3E%C2%A0cooling%20cover%20features%20cool-to-the-touch%20fabric%20that%20absorbs%20body%20heat.%20With%20breathable%20sheets%2C%20you%20feel%20that%20floating%20through.%20GlacioTex%20technology%20involves%20high-thermal-conductivity%20fibers%20made%20of%20polyester%20and%20polyethylene.%20Think%20of%20the%20cool%20side%20of%20the%20pillow%2C%20but%20across%20the%20entire%20surface%20of%20the%20bed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFoam%20is%20quilted%20beneath%20it%20to%20create%20a%20thinner%20cushioning%20layer%2C%20followed%20by%20a%201.5-inch%20layer%20of%20copper-infused%20foam.%20The%20copper%20infusion%20does%20the%20heavy%20lifting%20for%20absorbing%20body%20heat.%20Keep%20in%20mind%20that%20memory%20foam%20tends%20to%20trap%20heat%20to%20provide%20pressure%20relief%3B%20the%20copper%20helps%20mitigate%20that.%20Two%20more%20layers%20of%20foam%20follow%2C%20designed%20to%20move%20with%20you%20while%20providing%20a%20buffer%20between%20the%20upper%20layers%20and%20the%20pocketed%20coils%20beneath.%20Coils%20may%20not%20seem%20flashy%2C%20but%20they%E2%80%99re%20integral%20to%20internal%20airflow%20and%20customized%20pressure%20relief%20as%20each%20coil%20separately%20adapts%20to%20your%20body%20weight%20across%20the%20surface%20of%20the%20bed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EBefore%20you%20upgrade%20to%20the%20pillow%20top%E2%80%A6%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20Aurora%20Luxe%20Cooling%20is%20available%20in%20three%20firmness%20levels%3A%20soft%2C%20medium%2C%20and%20firm.%20We%E2%80%99ve%20tested%20the%20firm%2C%20which%20yielded%20very%20little%20sink%2C%20but%20a%20lot%20of%20spine%20support.%20It%E2%80%99s%20the%20best%20fit%20for%20heavy%20body%20types%2C%20stomach%20sleepers%2C%20and%20people%20with%20back%20pain.%20Anything%20softer%20than%20this%20%E2%80%94%20including%20adding%20a%20pillow%20top%20%E2%80%94%20works%20for%20side%20and%20back%20sleepers%2C%20but%20likely%20won%E2%80%99t%20feel%20supportive%20enough%20for%20these%20categories%20of%20sleepers.%20Apart%20from%20cooling%2C%20of%20course.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22553408e9-c02c-45f3-b96e-d0fc0ca94ac7%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20value%5C%22%3EBest%20value%3C%2Fh2%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%20makes%20it%20cooling%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Combines%20a%20heat-dissipating%20graphite%20lumbar%20zone%2C%20gel%20memory%20foam%2C%20and%20a%20breathable%20high-airflow%20coil%20base.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ETop-to-bottom%20cooling%20design.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EWe're%20always%20on%20the%20lookout%20for%20budget%20cooling%20mattresses%2C%20but%20have%20yet%20to%20find%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-cheap-mattresses%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esub-%24500%20option%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20is%20truly%20peak.%20But%20for%20very%20close%20to%20%241%2C000%2C%20a%20yearlong%20sleep%20trial%2C%20and%20lifetime%20warranty%20coverage%2C%20there%20was%20no%20contest%20that%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D1bbdcb060b6efd314cfb33ca5f6ebda1c2bc244d2a1db203dd857c8fa7f68ff7%26postID%3D6aa32106d49152a6be8fbfc1%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-cooling-mattresses%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fglaciersleep.com%252Fproducts%252Fglacier-summit%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGlacier%20Summit%20Hybrid%3C%2Fa%3E%20mattress%20was%20performing%20on%20par%20with%20not%20just%20the%20options%20on%20this%20list%2C%20but%20also%20luxury%20mattresses.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20includes%20key%20materials%20you'd%20see%20in%20standard%20cooling%20mattresses%2C%20such%20as%20a%20cooling%20cover%2C%20cooling%20foam%2C%20and%20pocketed%20coils%20to%20promote%20internal%20airflow.%20Interestingly%2C%20it%20also%20appears%20in%20features%20reminiscent%20of%20those%20of%20luxury%20competitors%2C%20such%20as%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3Da1349b68740e2f469aa5e05f0c8e0820a0ed321c1709162885a24e66d1511a46%26postID%3D6aa32106d49152a6be8fbfc1%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-cooling-mattresses%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.saatva.com%252Fmattresses%252Fsaatva-classic%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ESaatva%20Classic%3C%2Fa%3E.%20This%20includes%20a%20pillow%20top%20for%20pressure%20relief%20and%20lumbar%20support%20via%20reinforced%20stitching%20at%20the%20center%2C%20plus%20a%20targeted%20lumbar-support%20foam%20layer%20under%20the%20pillow%20top%20to%20lift%20your%20lower%20back.%20The%20biggest%20difference%20is%20that%20the%20Summit's%20lumbar%20zone%20layer%20uses%20graphite%20foam%20to%20pull%20heat%20away%20from%20you%2C%20followed%20by%20a%20gel-infused%20foam%20comfort%20layer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20medium%20firmness%20worked%20well%20for%20nearly%20every%20sleep%20position%3B%20however%2C%20some%20stomach%20sleepers%20may%20need%20something%20a%20bit%20firmer%20for%20spine%20alignment.%20Additionally%2C%20edge%20support%20showed%20some%20serious%20sink%20around%20the%20edges%2C%20but%20only%20while%20sitting.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDoesn't%20hold%20on%20to%20heat.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EWhat%20quickly%20became%20apparent%20in%20testing%20wasn't%20just%20the%20solid%20motion%20isolation%20and%20spine-alignment%20support%20for%20combination%20sleepers.%20When%20measured%20with%20a%20temperature%20gun%2C%20it%20was%20one%20of%20the%20fastest%20beds%20to%20release%20heat%20after%20sleeping%20on%20it%2C%20returning%20to%20a%20baseline%20temperature%20of%2070%E2%84%89%20within%202%20minutes%20in%20every%20test%20we%20ran.%20The%20cover%20and%20internal%20materials%20were%20truly%20breathable%2C%20promoting%20cooling%20and%20preventing%20heat%20retention.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2273489522-4120-486a-88f4-469d802dfbe2%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20for%20couples%20and%20combination%20sleepers%5C%22%3EBest%20for%20couples%20and%20combination%20sleepers%3C%2Fh2%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%20makes%20it%20cooling%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EPairs%20a%20cool-to-the-touch%20Ver-Tex%E2%84%A2%20cover%20with%20mesh%20side%20air%20vents%20for%20continuous%20lateral%20ventilation.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EFinding%20a%20mattress%20for%20couples%20is%20usually%20easier%20said%20than%20done.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Many%20markets%20that%20they'll%20keep%20both%20sleepers%20cool%2C%20supported%2C%20and%20from%20feeling%20each%20other's%20movements.%20That's%20not%20always%20the%20case.%20But%20after%20trying%20Bedgear's%20recently%20revamped%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3Da55684d4bc8b026337a0aeae3809056f803c6c026b361c65ff66a3c42697c084%26postID%3D6aa32106d49152a6be8fbfc1%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-cooling-mattresses%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fgo.skimresources.com%252F%253Fid%253D35871X943606%2526amp%253Burl%253Dhttps%25253A%25252F%25252Fbedgear.com%25252Fproducts%25252Fh-performance-mattress%25253Fvariant%25253D43699899760780%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EH%20Performance%20series%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20the%20mattress%20delivers%20on%20cooling%2C%20edge%20support%2C%20and%20motion%20isolation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBedgear's%20approach%20to%20staying%20cool%20relies%20on%20a%20polyethylene-based%20Ver-Tex%20cooling%20cover%2C%20pocketed%20coils%2C%20and%20air%20vents%20covered%20with%20mesh%20on%20both%20sides%20of%20the%20mattress.%20The%20cover%20itself%20is%20very%20cool%20to%20the%20touch%20at%20first%20contact%2C%20but%20it%20faded%20pretty%20quickly%20once%20I%20settled%20into%20the%20bed.%20As%20time%20went%20on%2C%20it%20became%20clear%20that%20it%20was%20working%20to%20regulate%20surface%20temperature%2C%20keeping%20things%20even-keeled%20rather%20than%20frigid.%20Still%2C%20if%20that's%20the%20essence%20you're%20going%20for%2C%20definitely%20use%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-cooling-sheets%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecooling%20sheets%3C%2Fa%3E%20here.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221440%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bedgear%20mattress%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa4411b9b8974787b1cb26c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221080%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EIn%20addition%20to%20a%20cool-to-the-touch%20cover%2C%20Bedgear%20added%20mesh%20vents%20along%20the%20side%20of%20the%20bed%20to%20enhance%20airflow.%3Cp%3EJulia%20Forbes%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20took%20about%20three%20days%20for%20the%20bed%20to%20truly%20feel%20medium-firm%2C%20but%20that%20tracks%20with%20how%20mattresses-in-a-box%20typically%20work.%20The%20foam%20needs%20time%20to%20fully%20inflate%20after%20being%20compressed.%20Once%20the%20intended%20firmness%20was%20achieved%2C%20I%20found%20it%20comfortable%20to%20sleep%20on%20my%20side%2C%20back%2C%20or%20stomach.%20You%20generally%20want%20a%20firmer%20feel%20under%20your%20lower%20back%20to%20protect%20your%20lumbar%20zone%20and%20prevent%20sinking.%20I%20got%20that%20with%20the%20H4%2C%20and%20the%20cushiness%20of%20the%20overhauled%20pillow%20top%20didn't%20detract%20from%20that%20by%20causing%20overt%20sinking%20around%20the%20hips%20and%20torso.%20Instead%2C%20I%20felt%20a%20good%20amount%20of%20pressure%20relief.%20For%20side%20sleepers%2C%20sleeping%20with%20a%20body%20pillow%20also%20helped%20keep%20weight%20off%20my%20hips%20and%20shoulders%20%E2%80%94%20altogether%2C%20between%20the%20bed%20and%20accessories%2C%20I%20felt%20pretty%20weightless.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20real%20surprise%20was%20how%20well%20the%20motion%20isolation%20was.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EIn%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fhow-we-test-mattresses%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etesting%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20even%20when%20dropping%20weights%20onto%20the%20surface%2C%20the%20seismic%20vibration%20meter%20app%20I%20used%20detected%20very%20little%20motion%20transfer.%20This%20bodes%20well%20for%20couples%20who%20move%20around%20on%20their%20respective%20sides%20of%20the%20bed.%20Plus%2C%20the%20edge%20support%20was%20excellent%2C%20as%20I%20could%20sit%20or%20lie%20on%20it%20and%20felt%20like%20I%20wouldn't%20budge.%20Sometimes%2C%20with%20silkier-feeling%20covers%2C%20like%20the%20H4%2C%20sleepers%20may%20feel%20as%20if%20they%20will%20slide%20right%20off.%20That%20wasn't%20the%20case%20here%2C%20as%20the%20pillow%20top%20kept%20me%20firmly%20in%20place%20during%20testing.%20For%20couples%20who%20insist%20their%20partner%20stay%20on%20their%20side%20of%20the%20mattress%2C%20edge%20support%20comes%20in%20handy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a5fd2652-6142-4614-a134-28528f798f87%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20for%20back%20pain%5C%22%3EBest%20for%20back%20pain%3C%2Fh2%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%20makes%20it%20cooling%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EUtilizes%20a%20Celliant%C2%AE%20heat-converting%20bioceramic%20cover%2C%20dual%20copper-infused%20foam%20layers%2C%20and%20zoned%20airflow%20coils.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EMaintaining%20spine%20alignment%20through%20a%20firmer%20feel.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ESleepers%20who%20have%20dealt%20with%20back%20pain%20%E2%80%94%20about%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Fbooks%2FNBK586768%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E80%25%20of%20US%20adults%3C%2Fa%3E%20at%20any%20given%20point%20in%20their%20lives%20%E2%80%94%20will%20tell%20you%20how%20disruptive%20it%20is.%20If%20you%20are%20also%20dealing%20with%20overheating%2C%20it's%20a%20miserable%20experience.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3a845e1c6f9d6128b11d727e455713b2c78eb93482af8d4a8968ab5b5405a896%26postID%3D6aa32106d49152a6be8fbfc1%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-cooling-mattresses%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.bearmattress.com%252Fproducts%252Felite-hybrid-mattress%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBear%20Elite%20Hybrid%3C%2Fa%3E%20comes%20in%20three%20firmness%20levels%2C%20including%20soft%2C%20medium%2C%20and%20firm%2C%20the%20latter%20two%20are%20good%20fits%20for%20sleepers%20combating%20back%20pain.%20These%20two%20firmness%20levels%20will%20provide%20better%20weight%20distribution%20while%20maintaining%20pressure%20relief%2C%20so%20that%20the%20spine%20does%20not%20curve%20out%20of%20its%20natural%20alignment%20when%20heavier%20areas%20(like%20the%20hips%20and%20shoulders)%20sink%20in%20more%20than%20the%20other%20areas%20of%20your%20body.%20Side%20sleepers%20and%20smaller-stature%20body%20types%20may%20gravitate%20toward%20the%20softer%20medium%2C%20while%20stomach%20sleepers%2C%20heavyweight%20sleepers%2C%20and%20those%20with%20more%20advanced%20back%20pain%20should%20opt%20for%20firm.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bear%20elite%20hybrid%20mattress%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6797ff357bb3f854015a91c7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20mix%20of%20breathable%20foam%20and%20well-designed%20coils%20aims%20to%20create%20a%20mattress%20that%20combines%20the%20best%20of%20both%20worlds.%3Cp%3EBrendan%20Griffiths%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow%20the%20cooling%20features%20help%20you%20hibernate.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThere%20are%20several%20cooling%20components%20at%20work%20within%20the%20Bear%20Elite%20Hybrid%20that%20also%20subsequently%20help%20with%20back%20pain.%20The%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fcelliant.com%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECelliant%3C%2Fa%3E%20cover%20uses%20a%20bioceramic%20mineral%20infusion%20that%20has%20been%20studied%20for%20its%20effects%20on%20tissue%20recovery.%20It%20works%20by%20absorbing%20the%20body%20heat%20it%20comes%20into%20contact%20with%2C%20converting%20it%20into%20infrared%20energy.%20Through%20that%20contact%2C%20the%20energy%20reflects%20back%20to%20the%20body%20to%20promote%20recovery%20while%20giving%20off%20a%20cool-to-the-touch%20feel.%20These%20are%20big%20claims%2C%20but%20we%20can%20verify%20that%20the%20bed%20provides%20a%20refreshing%2C%20cooling%20feel.%20There's%20also%20the%20option%20to%20add%20on%20a%20%26quot%3BCoolForce%26quot%3B%20layer%2C%20which%20adds%20a%20PCM%20within%20the%20quilted%20comfort%20layer%20designed%20to%20help%20you%20sleep%20up%20to%204%20degrees%20cooler%2C%20but%20it%20costs%20an%20extra%20%24185.%20The%20bed%20also%20doesn't%20retain%20heat%3B%20in%20testing%2C%20it%20dropped%2010%20degrees%20within%202%20minutes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Bear%20Elite%20Hybrid%20also%20involves%20two%20layers%20of%20copper-infused%20foam%20and%20responsive%20foam%20to%20promote%20even%20pressure%20relief%20and%20reinforce%20balanced%20weight%20distribution%20atop%20the%20mattress.%20Pocketed%20coils%20are%20also%20a%20deliberate%20choice%20for%20back%20pain%20support%2C%20as%20firmer%20coils%20placed%20under%20the%20midsection%20prevent%20that%20area%20from%20sinking%20in%20too%20much.%20Plus%2C%20they%20add%20internal%20breathability%20to%20let%20the%20other%20cooling%20materials%20optimally%20perform.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESee%20our%20full%20review%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbear-elite-hybrid-mattress-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EBear%20Elite%20Hybrid%3C%2Fa%3E.%20For%20more%20options%2C%20read%20our%20guide%20on%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-mattress-for-back-pain%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebest%20mattresses%20for%20back%20pain%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22b546d461-4dc7-48c7-911c-f70ecd2d7d58%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20hybrid%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest%20hybrid%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%20makes%20it%20cooling%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ERelies%20on%20open-cell%20comfort%20foam%20and%20a%20pocketed%20coil%20core%20engineered%20for%20continuous%20internal%20air%20circulation.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EBalancing%20act.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20Casper%20Dream%20Hybrid%20takes%20a%20well-rounded%20approach%20to%20cooling%20and%20support%2C%20combining%20breathable%20foams%20with%20pocketed%20coils.%20While%20the%20standard%20cover%20isn%E2%80%99t%20cool%20to%20the%20touch%20(the%20QuickCool%20one%20is%2C%20but%20for%20an%20additional%20fee)%2C%20the%20standout%20feature%20of%20this%20mattress%20is%20airflow.%20With%20a%20breathable%20cover%2C%20open-cell%20foam%20dedicated%20to%20air%20circulation%2C%20and%20pocketed%20coils%20that%20generate%20said%20airflow%20internally%2C%20it%E2%80%99s%20an%20even-keeled%20recipe%20for%20successful%20temperature%20regulation.%20The%20bed%20stayed%202%20degrees%20cooler%20than%20our%20average%20and%20dropped%20by%2012%20degrees%20within%202%20minutes%2C%20demonstrating%20excellent%20heat%20dissipation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221563%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20Casper%20Dream%20Hybrid%20Mattress%20is%20displayed%20in%20a%20bedroom.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F665a35fccc442a2f676ced3e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221172%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Casper%20Dream%20sleeps%20cool%20despite%20lacking%20any%20specific%20cooling%20technologies.%3Cp%3EJames%20Brains%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EApart%20from%20keeping%20you%20from%20overheating%2C%20the%20Dream%20Hybrid%20has%20a%20firmer-than-average%20feel%20that%20our%20tester%20suggested%20as%20best%20for%20back%20and%20stomach%20sleepers.%20Though%20we%20think%20heavyweight%20stomach%20sleepers%20may%20find%20it%20slightly%20too%20soft%20to%20keep%20their%20hips%20elevated.%20The%20zoned%20support%20helps%20keep%20the%20center%20third%20from%20sinking%20too%20low.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you%20really%20wanted%20to%20amp%20up%20the%20cooling%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D9e17228d989ef3116d05ff6805d58d490c94daae11f9c7ef6e0b5a3c8416c28b%26postID%3D6aa32106d49152a6be8fbfc1%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-cooling-mattresses%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fcasper.com%252Fproducts%252Fcasper-snow-v3%253Fvariant%253D41670971949137%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECasper%20Snow%20Hybrid%3C%2Fa%3E%20uses%20a%20near-identical%20design%20but%20adds%20a%20QuickCool%20cooling%20cover%2C%20phase-change%20material%2C%20and%20aluminum-graphite%20heat-dissipation%20bands%20between%20the%20foam%20layers.%20It%20also%20swaps%20classic%20foam%20for%20memory%20foam%20comfort%20layers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ERead%20our%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fcasper-dream-mattress-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECasper%20Dream%20Hybrid%20Review%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20check%20out%20our%20guides%20to%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-mattresses-for-back-sleepers%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebest%20mattresses%20for%20back%20sleepers%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-mattress-for-stomach-sleepers%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Estomach%20sleepers%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%226b8a79ee-c515-4908-bda9-af48d67fcf40%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20memory%20foam%5C%22%3EBest%20memory%20foam%3C%2Fh2%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%20makes%20it%20cooling%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EFeatures%20a%20SmartClimate%C2%AE%20cool-touch%20dual%20cover%2C%20PureCool%2B%C2%AE%20phase-change%20material%2C%20and%20perforated%20TEMPUR%C2%AE%20foam%20to%20sleep%20up%20to%205%20degrees%20cooler%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EA%20memory%20foam%20bed%20that%20defeats%20heat.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EHistorically%2C%20memory%20foam%20has%20fallen%20short%20of%20delivering%20a%20truly%20%26quot%3Bcooling%26quot%3B%20feel.%20Memory%20foam%20requires%20heat%20absorption%20to%20provide%20pressure%20relief%2C%20but%20as%20a%20result%2C%20it's%20unable%20to%20let%20air%20flow%20through.%20Heat%20gets%20stuck%2C%20and%20as%20a%20result%2C%20you%20feel%20overheated.%20The%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3De3b77a583adf7d715cabbe3a5c928f7eab4e151e35c4e2d1578ea1f9a8b9a5e3%26postID%3D6aa32106d49152a6be8fbfc1%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-cooling-mattresses%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.tempurpedic.com%252Fshop-mattresses%252Fbreeze-collection%252Fv%252F3934%252F%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ETempur-Pedic%20ProBreeze%20%3C%2Fa%3Eis%20one%20such%20bed%20where%20you%20don't%20have%20to%20worry%20about%20this%2C%20as%20it%20has%20one%20of%20the%20most%20impressive%20cooling%20covers%20I've%20come%20across%20to%20date.%20It's%20designed%20to%20feel%20five%20degrees%20cooler%3B%20while%20that%20can%20vary%20from%20case%20to%20case%2C%20and%20I%20can't%20readily%20prove%20that%20claim%2C%20I%20did%20feel%20it%20provided%20a%20cooler-than-most%20feel%2C%20on%20par%20with%20the%20Aurora%20Luxe%20Cooling.%20If%20that%20wasn't%20enough%20cooling%2C%20the%20LuxeBreeze%20is%20supposed%20to%20amp%20things%20up%20to%20a%2010-degree%20difference%E2%80%94again%2C%20I%20can't%20prove%20that%20readily%2C%20but%20it%20did%20feel%20a%20%3Cem%3Esmidge%3C%2Fem%3E%20cooler%20than%20the%20ProBreeze%2C%20and%20makes%20bedding%20feel%20cold%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EPressure%20relief%20is%20fundamental%20here.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20all-foam%20medium%20uses%20several%20materials%20to%20absorb%20and%20dissipate%20body%20heat%2C%20including%20a%20heat-diffusing%20layer%2C%20%26quot%3BPure%20Cool%26quot%3B%20absorption%20material%20layer%2C%20and%20a%20base%20of%20ventilated%20foam.%20Altogether%2C%20it%20still%20accomplishes%20the%20essence%20of%20what%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Ftempur-pedic-mattress-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ETempur-Pedic%20brand%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20renowned%20for%3A%20pressure%20relief.%20It%20molds%20around%20your%20body%20like%20one%20leaves%20a%20footprint%20in%20the%20sand%20%E2%80%94%20a%20near-exact%20impression.%20This%20helps%20give%20your%20pressure%20points%20the%20exact%20level%20of%20pressure%20relief%20they%20need.%20To%20that%20end%2C%20it%20still%20may%20feel%20too%20soft%20for%20those%20with%20back%20pain%2C%20given%20the%20sink-in%20feel%20here.%20Shifting%20between%20sleeping%20positions%2C%20or%20for%20couples%20with%20different%20sleeping%20positions%2C%20can%20also%20require%20more%20effort%2C%20as%20it%20takes%20a%20minute%20or%20two%20for%20the%20foam%20to%20return%20to%20a%20flat%20surface.%20If%20shifting%20positions%20is%20a%20concern%2C%20or%20you%20prefer%20something%20a%20little%20firmer%2C%20our%20tester%2C%20who%20tried%20the%20medium%20hybrid%20version%2C%20thought%20it%20ran%20a%20little%20firmer%2C%20making%20it%20better%20suited%20for%20stomach%20and%20back%20sleepers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESee%20our%20guide%20to%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-foam-mattress%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebest%20foam%20mattresses%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229fa5c418-05cd-43f4-aa41-6b8b570c2d90%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20latex%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest%20latex%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%20makes%20it%20cooling%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EBuilt%20with%20naturally%20breathable%20open-cell%20Dunlop%20latex%2C%20moisture-wicking%20organic%20wool%2C%20and%20an%20airy%20organic%20cotton%20cover.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ERelies%20on%20all-natural%20materials%20rather%20than%20human%20invention.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ECooling%20materials%20used%20in%20mattresses%2C%20accessories%2C%20and%20sleep%20tech%20are%20always%20evolving%20and%20improving.%20While%20these%20are%20exciting%20developments%2C%20some%20still%20prefer%20organic%20materials%20over%20manmade%20ones%2C%20due%20to%20health%20concerns%20or%20general%20eco-friendliness.%20Latex%20mattresses%20offer%20benefits%20typically%20associated%20with%20materials%20like%20memory%20foam%2C%20such%20as%20pressure%20relief%20and%20support%2C%20without%20retaining%20heat.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20PlushBeds%20Botanical%20Bliss%20is%20outfitted%20with%20three%20ventilated%20layers%20of%20Global%20Organic%20Latex%20Standard%20and%20Eco-Institut%20certified%20latex.%20In%20other%20words%2C%20it's%20the%20real%20deal%2C%20top-of-the-line%20latex%20being%20used%20here.%20The%20mattress%20also%20implements%20both%20Global%20Organic%20Textile%20Standard-certified%20organic%20cotton%20in%20its%20cover%20and%20wool%20serving%20as%20the%20topmost%20padding.%20Candidly%2C%20none%20of%20these%20materials%20will%20offer%20the%20same%20cool-to-the-touch%20feel%20as%20man-made%20cooling%20fabrics.%20However%2C%20they%20regulate%20temperature%20and%20remain%20breathable%2C%20letting%20body%20heat%20pass%20through%20and%20dissipate%2C%20so%20no%20heat%20builds%20up%20around%20you.%20Plus%2C%20there%20are%20zero%20chemical%20components%20involved%2C%20whether%20that's%20cooling%20treatments%2C%20pesticides%2C%20or%20other%20chemicals.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22plushbeds%20mattress%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6798047e196626c4098536a2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20PlushBeds%20Botanical%20Bliss%20uses%20organic%20cotton%2C%20wool%2C%20and%20natural%20latex%20to%20maintain%20temperature%20neutrality%20without%20synthetic%20cooling%20chemicals.%3Cp%3EJames%20Brains%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EPressure-relief%20first%20and%20foremost.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EAside%20from%20temperature%20neutrality%2C%20pressure%20relief%20is%20arguably%20the%20most%20notable%20feature%20of%20latex.%20It%20has%20natural%20buoyancy%20and%20responsiveness%2C%20so%20you%20feel%20consistently%20supported%20as%20you%20move%2C%20while%20pressure%20points%20are%20gently%20bolstered.%20Depending%20on%20your%20body%20type%20and%20sleep%20position%2C%20you%20can%20opt%20for%20either%20the%20medium%20or%20slightly%20medium-firm%20setting%2C%20as%20well%20as%20heights%20of%209%2C%2010%2C%20or%2012%20inches.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20height%20and%20firmness%20customization%20is%20helpful%2C%20as%20it%20makes%20the%20bed%20an%20option%20for%20multiple%20sleeping%20positions%20and%20body%20types.%20Stomach%20sleepers%20should%20lean%20towards%20the%20firmer%209%20or%2010%20inches.%20On%20the%20other%20hand%2C%20thicker%20latex%20slabs%20give%20more%20to%20sink%20into%2C%20which%20works%20well%20for%20side%20sleepers%20and%20heavy%20body%20types.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EEdge%20support%20isn't%20its%20strongest%20suit.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EA%20common%20pitfall%20with%20latex%20mattresses%20is%20that%2C%20given%20their%20flexibility%2C%20they%20don't%20do%20so%20well%20at%20maintaining%20strong%20edge%20support%E2%80%94something%20testers%20and%20I%20immediately%20noticed%20with%20the%20PlushBeds%20Botanical%20Bliss.%20If%20you%20often%20sit%20or%20sleep%20on%20the%20sides%20of%20the%20bed%2C%20you%20may%20not%20feel%20super%20secure%20on%20it.%20Also%2C%20be%20careful%20while%20unboxing%20and%20moving%20this%20bed%2C%20as%20latex%20is%20very%20floppy%20and%20incredibly%20heavy.%20Reinforced%20handles%20aid%20in%20moving%20it%20when%20needed%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d5acbab7-98f6-49b3-a184-afba67936428%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20organic%5C%22%3EBest%20organic%3C%2Fh2%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%20makes%20it%20cooling%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EBlends%20temperature-regulating%20organic%20wool%2C%20pin-vented%20natural%20latex%2C%20and%20over%201%2C400%20airflow-promoting%20coils.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Check%20out%20our%20guide%20to%20the%20best%20organic%20mattresses.%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ECertified%20organic.%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EMany%20mattresses%20can%20claim%20to%20be%20all-natural%2C%20organic%2C%20and%20cooling.%20Very%20few%20have%20the%20receipts%20to%20back%20that%20up.%20The%20brand's%20signature%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3Dceb6e678a43631955a75d210193401ab879e6c38c372b06557857300feae1efd%26postID%3D6aa32106d49152a6be8fbfc1%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-cooling-mattresses%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.avocadogreenmattress.com%252Fproducts%252Fgreen-natural-organic-mattress%253Fvariant%253D42732672549014%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAvocado%20Green%20Hybrid%20mattress%3C%2Fa%3E%20takes%20its%20eco-friendly%20claims%20seriously%2C%20with%20six%20third-party%20certifications%20to%20ensure%20it's%20truly%20organic%2C%20including%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.controlunion.com%2Fcertification-program%2Fgols-global-organic-latex-standard%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGlobal%20Organic%20Latex%20Standard%20(GOLS)%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fglobal-standards.org%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGlobal%20Organic%20Textile%20Standard%20(GOTS)%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.oeko-tex.com%2Fen%2Four-standards%2Foeko-tex-standard-100%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EOEKO-TEX%20Standard%20100%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ewg.org%2Fewgverified%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EEWG%20Verified%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fmadesafe.org%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EMade%20Safe%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%C2%A0%3Ca%20href