3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHybrid%20versus%20all-foam%20construction%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EIn%20most%20cases%2C%20hybrid%20mattresses%20outperform%20all-foam%20beds%20in%20temperature%20regulation%20and%20in%20maintaining%20an%20overall%20cooler%20feel.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nasa.gov%2Fimage-article%2Fmemory-foam%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EFoam%20was%20invented%20%3C%2Fa%3Eto%20absorb%20heat%2C%20with%20microscopic%20air%20bubbles%20that%20hold%20it%20in%20place%2C%20making%20the%20material%20more%20malleable.%20This%20is%20what%20makes%20it%20first-rate%20for%20pressure%20relief%2C%20but%20infamous%20for%20heat%20retention.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EVentilated%20foams%20that%20allow%20air%20to%20pass%20through%20are%20infused%20with%20cooling%20treatments%2C%20such%20as%20phase-change%20material%20or%20gel%2C%20to%20dissipate%20heat%20buildup.%20While%20these%20things%20do%20help%2C%20they%20still%20need%20to%20be%20incorporated%20with%20other%20materials%2C%20such%20as%20coils%20that%20generate%20internal%20airflow%20and%20cooling%20covers%2C%20to%20maximize%20performance.%20Pocketed%20coils%20are%20better%20for%20pressure%20relief%20than%20traditional%20innerspring%20ones%2C%20but%20don't%20have%20the%20soft%20feel%20memory%20foam%20is%20revered%20for.%20Their%20movement%20inside%20the%20bed%20when%20you%20move%20creates%20the%20actual%20airflow%2C%20and%20while%20it's%20not%20a%20torrent%2C%20it%20prevents%20heat%20from%20stagnating%20within.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ESurface%20fabrics%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ECooling%20covers%20can%20go%20a%20long%20way%20toward%20regulating%20perceived%20temperature.%20They%20feel%20cool%20to%20the%20touch%20while%20absorbing%20excess%20body%20heat%20to%20help%20you%20sleep%20better.%20Look%20for%20covers%20that%20include%20phase-change%20material%20and%20cooling%20fibers%20such%20as%20Celliant%20or%20polyethylene%2C%20as%20they%20help%20achieve%20this%20effect.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22e462760e-6464-42a2-a6b0-2e472f02d062%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22How%20we%20tested%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow%20we%20tested%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221200%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22side%20by%20side%20of%20a%20woman%20taking%20a%20temperature%20reading%20and%20another%20measuring%20the%20bed's%20edge%20support%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa443989b8974787b1cb287%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22900%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWe've%20developed%20repeatable%20objective%20tests%20for%20each%20mattress%20that%20consider%20heat%20dissipation%2C%20edge%20support%2C%20motion%20isolation%2C%20and%20other%20factors.%3Cp%3EJulia%20Forbes%3B%20Sarah%20Saril%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ECooling%20mattresses%20are%20our%20focus%20here%2C%20but%20we%20also%20have%20to%20keep%20in%20mind%20the%20holistic%20experience%20of%20buying%20(and%20sleeping%20on)%20a%20mattress%20long%20term.%20To%20ensure%20you're%20getting%20the%20best%20possible%20investment%20for%20your%20sleep%2C%20we%20also%20take%20the%20following%20into%20account%20in%20our%20testing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229773faf3-7aa6-43a6-a315-680cc79cabb3%5C%22%3ESetup%20and%20usability%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20this%20test%2C%20we%20assess%20the%20ease%20of%20setup%20from%20the%20moment%20a%20bed%20arrives%20at%20our%20home%20until%20it's%20fully%20ready%20for%20sleep.%20We%20note%20how%20big%20and%20heavy%20boxes%20are%20to%20move%2C%20if%20setup%20involves%20more%20than%20one%20person%20(or%20if%20in-home%20setup%20options%20are%20available)%2C%20and%20how%20long%20we%20need%20to%20wait%20after%20unboxing%20a%20bed%20before%20using%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22580751e8-e861-4bc5-add9-6c1f4fc36a5e%5C%22%3ECooling%20performance%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EUsing%20an%20infrared%20temperature%20gun%2C%20we%20collected%20precise%20data%20to%20assess%20how%20well%20each%20bed%20dissipated%20heat%2C%20especially%20relative%20to%20its%20claims.%20We%20take%20the%20baseline%20temperature%20before%20going%20to%20bed%2C%20get%20another%20reading%20after%20we%20first%20get%20out%20of%20bed%2C%20and%20then%20come%20back%20two%20minutes%20later%20to%20gauge%20how%20quickly%20it%20dissipates%20heat.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22dd001a78-db2b-45ea-9c5f-788e20a0f2b4%5C%22%3EOvernight%20comfort%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3ESupport%2C%20pressure%20relief%2C%20edge%20support%2C%20responsiveness%2C%20and%20motion%20isolation%20are%20all%20vital%20to%20a%20good%20mattress%20performance%20and%20bode%20well%20for%20better%20sleep.%20We%20have%20specific%20tests%20that%20measure%20how%20much%20we%20sink%20into%20the%20bed%20when%20sitting%20on%20the%20edges%20of%20a%20mattress%2C%20as%20well%20as%20a%20motion-isolation%20test%20that%20uses%20weights%20to%20jostle%20the%20bed%20as%20best%20we%20can%20to%20simulate%20couples%20moving.%20From%20there%2C%20a%20seismic%20vibrometer%20app%20measures%20how%20effectively%20we%20shook%20the%20bed%20and%2C%20more%20importantly%2C%20how%20well%20the%20mattress%20did%20at%20stopping%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%223b903ce6-2eff-4c22-b783-ca71b53a97de%5C%22%3ECoverage%20and%20policies%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EMattresses%20are%20a%20long-term%20investment%20that%20you%20use%20nightly%20%E2%80%94%20you%20want%20to%20ensure%20you%20are%20getting%20exactly%20what%20you%20need%2C%20and%20have%20the%20assurance%20of%20assistance%20if%20something%20goes%20wrong.%20We%20also%20look%20for%20shipping%20policies%2C%20such%20as%20whether%20setup%20is%20handled%20by%20you%20or%20included%20in%20the%20bed's%20cost%2C%20a%20lengthy%20sleep%20trial%20so%20you%20can%20try%20out%20the%20mattress%20for%20yourself%20within%20a%20set%20time%20window%2C%20and%20the%20ability%20to%20return%20it%20for%20a%20full%20refund.%20Warranty%20coverage%20is%20essential%20for%20safeguarding%20the%20mattress's%20construction.%20If%20any%20defective%20parts%20interfere%20with%20its%20performance%2C%20companies%20can%20step%20in%20to%20repair%20or%20replace%20them%20as%20part%20of%20your%20purchase.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22cc7c08b1-7ffe-4919-aaf7-c1bffd4ab7b7%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Meet%20the%20expert%5C%22%3EMeet%20the%20expert%20behind%20the%20guide%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EJulia%20Forbes%2C%20contributor%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Julia%20is%20a%20mattress%20tester%20with%20over%206%20years%20of%20experience%2C%20having%20tested%20more%20than%20160%20beds%20to%20date.%20She's%20a%20double-certified%20Spencer%20Institute%20sleep%20science%20and%20brain%20health%20coach.%20During%20her%20time%20as%20a%20consumer%20product%20journalist%2C%20she%20visits%20mattress%20factories%2C%20meets%20with%20industry%20experts%2C%20and%20researches%20new%20technology%20entering%20the%20mattress%20industry.%20Plus%2C%20she%20really%2C%20really%20likes%20sleeping.%20With%20the%20help%20of%20the%20Business%20Insider%20testing%20team%2C%20she%20contributed%20her%20insight%20for%20these%20cooling%20mattresses%20that%20made%20the%20cut.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%227d0e542b-b8c3-4bf2-8f18-eb5d750d8556%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22FAQs%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ECooling%20mattress%20FAQs%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Ch3%3EDo%20cooling%20mattresses%20actually%20work%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EYes%2C%20cooling%20mattresses%20work%2C%20but%20they%20function%20by%20absorbing%20and%20dissipating%20body%20heat%20rather%20than%20actively%20chilling%20you%20like%20an%20air%20conditioner.%20They%20rely%20on%20specific%20materials%20and%20structural%20design%20to%20prevent%20heat%20trapping%2C%20so%20you%20stay%20at%20a%20comfortable%2C%20neutral%20temperature.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EWhat%20cooling%20bedding%20and%20accessories%20can%20I%20use%20with%20my%20cooling%20mattress%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3ECooling%20mattresses%20can%20be%20a%20game%20changer%20for%20many%2C%20but%20consider%20these%20accessories%20to%20help%20it%20perform%20optimally%E2%80%94and%20you%20sleep%20cooler.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-bed-cooling-systems%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EBed%20cooling%20systems%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3A%20These%20go%20atop%20your%20existing%20mattress%20or%20cooling%20mattress%2C%20and%20use%20either%20air%20or%20water%20to%20regulate%20temperature%20throughout%20the%20night.%20Using%20sensors%20or%20presets%2C%20they%20can%20gauge%20body%20temperature%20fluctuations%20to%20run%20at%20a%20consistently%20cooler%20temperature%20or%20adapt%20to%20perceived%20dips%20or%20increases%20in%20your%20body%20temperature.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-cooling-sheets%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ECooling%20sheets%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Cooling%20mattresses%20benefit%20from%20breathable%20sheet%20sets%2C%20which%20allow%20them%20to%20deliver%20cool-to-the-touch%20covers%20that%20absorb%20body%20heat%20to%20work%20effectively.%20Plus%2C%20they%20can%20help%20amplify%20the%20bed's%20cooler%20feel.%20Materials%20like%20cotton%2C%20eucalyptus%2C%20bamboo%2C%20and%20linen%20are%20all%20airy%2C%20breathable%2C%20plant-based%20sources%20that%20make%20for%20great%20cooling%20sheets.%20Look%20for%20weaves%20like%20crisp-feeling%20percale%20or%20satin-like%20sateen%20for%20optimal%20cooling%20performance.%20Phase-change%20material%20sheets%20also%20exist%2C%20which%20absorb%20sweat%20to%20keep%20night-sweat%20sufferers%20cool%20and%20dry.%20I%20like%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22noopener%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D54bd934c02219a46fac25bc585eb202b01ed7523459eda70c7961b2685512410%26postID%3D6aa32106d49152a6be8fbfc1%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-cooling-mattresses%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fgo.skimresources.com%252F%253Fid%253D35871X943606%2526amp%253Burl%253Dhttps%25253A%25252F%25252Flusome.com%25252Fproducts%25252Ftemperature-regulating-cooling-sheets%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ELusom%C3%A9%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20is%20among%20the%20coolest%20sheet%20sets%20available%2C%20and%20weaves%20a%20special%20bio-based%20PCM%20material%20through%20the%20percale%20cotton.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-cooling-pillow%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ECooling%20pillows%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3A%20The%20same%20cooling%20fibers%20and%20materials%20used%20in%20mattress%20covers%2C%20such%20as%20polyethylene%20and%20phase-change%20materials%2C%20can%20also%20be%20incorporated%20into%20pillows.%20Look%20for%20ones%20that%20also%20use%20gel-infused%20memory%20foam%20for%20further%20pressure%20relief%20and%20temperature%20regulation%2C%20or%20natural%20materials%20like%20organic%20latex%20and%20cotton%20for%20breathability.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-cooling-comforters%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ECooling%20comforters%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EFluffier%20comforters%20are%20very%20cozy%2C%20though%20they%20can%20trap%20heat.%20While%20this%20could%20be%20helpful%20for%20cooler%20seasons%20and%20climates%2C%20it's%20not%20conducive%20for%20hot%20sleepers%20to%20use.%20Look%20for%20ones%20that%20use%20cooling%20outer%20shells%2C%20such%20as%20Tencel%2C%20cotton%2C%20or%20bamboo%2C%20to%20provide%20a%20breathable%2C%20cooling%20feel.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Ch3%3EWhat%20is%20the%20ideal%20sleep%20temperature%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20reality%20is%20that%20the%20%26quot%3Bideal%20sleep%20temperature%26quot%3B%20will%20vary%20from%20person%20to%20person.%20However%2C%20it's%20about%2065%20degrees%2C%20said%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22noopener%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.uclahealth.org%2Fproviders%2Falon-avidan%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAlon%20Y.%20Avidan%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20MD%2C%20MPH%2C%20director%20of%20the%20UCLA%20Sleep%20Disorders%20Center.%20%26quot%3BWe%20find%20that%20when%20it's%20greater%20than%2070%20degrees%2C%20people%20have%20more%20disrupted%20and%20interrupted%20sleep.%20Between%2060%20to%2065%20degrees%20seems%20to%20be%20ideal%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch3%3E%3Cstrong%3EAre%20cooling%20mattresses%20worth%20it%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EMaybe.%20If%20you%20would%20buy%20a%20new%20mattress%20anyway%2C%20consider%20a%20cooling%20mattress%20to%20help%20with%20overheating.%20If%20your%20mattress%20still%20has%20some%20years%20left%2C%20consider%20one%20of%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-cooling-mattress-topper-for-hot-sleepers%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebest%20cooling%20mattress%20toppers%3C%2Fa%3E%20instead.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-cooling-mattresses%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789210802000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa43f33ec15fe2d3cf165d0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-cooling-mattresses%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Stay%20cool%20and%20sweat-free%20all%20night%20with%20the%20best%20cooling%20mattresses%2C%20evaluated%20for%20temperature%20regulation%2C%20comfort%2C%20support%2C%20and%20heat%20dispersal.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Julia%20Forbes)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Why%20%E2%80%98Hanuman%20Ansh%E2%80%99%20won%E2%80%99t%20be%20India%E2%80%99s%20official%20Oscar%20entry%20this%20year%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789209445000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-134125302%2Cimgsize-469739.cms%2