igcaption%3EJodi%20Sprague%20and%20her%20daughter%2C%20Olivia%2C%20are%20both%20facing%20looming%20student-debt%20burdens.%3Cp%3EAlyssa%20Pointer%20for%20BI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20and%20Olivia%20began%20to%20cry.%20Olivia%20was%20about%20to%20start%20her%20sophomore%20year%20at%20Georgia%20Southern%20University%2C%20and%20while%20her%20parents%20helped%20her%20pay%20for%20housing%2C%20that%20likely%20wouldn't%20be%20possible%20in%20the%20upcoming%20semester.%20Her%20first%20thought%20when%20she%20learned%20of%20Jodi's%20payment%20increase%3A%20how%20would%20she%20afford%20her%20rent%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20150%25%20increase%20comes%20from%20President%20Donald%20Trump's%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhats-confusing-student-loan-borrowers-debt-repayment-save-glitches-forgiveness-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Estudent-loan%20repayment%20overhaul%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20took%20effect%20on%20July%201.%20It%20eliminated%20the%20Biden-era%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhen-will-save-plan-notices-come-student-loan-borrowers-repayment-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ESAVE%20repayment%20plan%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20gave%20Jodi%20and%20millions%20of%20other%20borrowers%20affordable%20monthly%20payments.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20administration%20said%20its%20changes%20are%20intended%20to%20curb%20excessive%20borrowing%2C%20simplify%20a%20complex%20repayment%20system%2C%20and%20compel%20colleges%20to%20lower%20their%20tuition.%20Over%20the%20past%20year%2C%20more%20than%20a%20thousand%20borrowers%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fworks-3-jobs-student-loan-debt-payments-surging-retirement-trump-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%20have%20told%20Business%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20they're%20taking%20on%20extra%20work%2C%20postponing%20retirement%2C%20and%20worrying%20they'll%20default%20because%20of%20higher%20monthly%20bills.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EThis%20story%20is%20part%20of%20Business%20Insider's%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcategory%2Fstudent-debt-spiral%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3E%26quot%3BStudent%20Debt%20Spiral%26quot%3B%20series%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%20which%20explores%20how%20rising%20student%20debt%20is%20changing%20the%20financial%20futures%20of%20millions.%20Do%20you%20have%20a%20story%20to%20share%3F%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%20nofollow%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fforms%2Fd%2Fe%2F1FAIpQLSeATa4iQeOzHtXhvcsvVIBfQLs3uacbq2N6OSrC5Eti5s6i1A%2Fviewform%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EFill%20out%20this%20form%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20we'll%20be%20in%20touch.%20Read%20more%20of%20our%20student-loan%20coverage%20here%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E'A%20bunch%20of%20red%20tape'%3A%20Student-loan%20borrowers%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstudent-loan-borrowers-customer-service-struggles-debt-repayment-servicers-trump-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3Ecan't%20get%20clear%20answers%3C%2Fa%3E%20from%20the%20companies%20that%20manage%20their%20debt%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EStudent-loan%20borrowers%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstudent-loan-borrowers-higher-monthly-payments-retirement-jobs-debt-trump-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3Eare%20pushing%20off%20retirement%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20delaying%20children%2C%20and%20taking%20on%203%20jobs%20to%20prep%20for%20repayment%20changes%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ENew%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstudent-loan-debt-repayment-glitches-borrower-budget-credit-scores-errors-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3Estudent-loan%20repayment%20glitches%3C%2Fa%3E%20are%20throwing%20borrowers'%20budgets%20into%20limbo%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EThe%20payment%20is%20in%20Jodi's%20name%2C%20but%20it%20will%20reshape%20decisions%20across%20the%20household.%20As%20Olivia%20prepares%20to%20borrow%20more%20for%20college%20and%20Evelyn%20weighs%20an%20expensive%20career%20path%2C%20Jodi%20and%20Paul%20have%20to%20decide%20how%20much%20more%20work%2C%20debt%2C%20and%20sacrifice%20the%20family%20can%20absorb.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhen%20the%20kids%20were%20little%2C%20and%20there%20was%20a%20dollar%20in%20our%20checking%20account%20until%20payday%2C%20we%20made%20it%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Jodi%2C%2054.%20Her%20student%20loans%20are%20no%20different.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20going%20to%20hurt%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said%2C%20%26quot%3Bbut%20I'm%20going%20to%20pay%20them.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Cp%3EJodi's%20parents%20saw%20college%20as%20the%20key%20to%20wealth%20and%20pushed%20their%20daughters%20to%20attend.%20At%2018%2C%20she%20borrowed%20a%20minimal%20amount%20to%20pursue%20a%20two-year%20degree%20at%20a%20small%20Bible%20college.%20Looking%20back%2C%20Jodi's%20shocked%20it%20was%20that%20easy%20to%20take%20on%20debt.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20seven%20years%20as%20a%20stay-at-home%20mom%20left%20her%20depressed%20and%20unfulfilled%2C%20Jodi%20decided%20to%20go%20back%20to%20school.%20Teaching%20would%20offer%20the%20challenge%20she%20needed%20and%20the%20career%20she%20wanted.%20Paul%2C%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Ea%20city%20employee%2C%20worried%20about%20managing%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fis-a-college-degree-worth-it-majors-completion-living-costs-2025-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecost%20of%20a%20degree%3C%2Fa%3E%20while%20raising%20a%20family%2C%20but%20he%20had%20faith%20in%20Jodi.%20%26quot%3BShe's%20always%20been%20very%20driven.%20Very%20smart.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJodi%20now%20has%20a%20%24144%2C000%20student-loan%20balance%2C%20from%20a%20history%20degree%20at%20Kennesaw%20State%20University%20and%20a%20master's%20in%20teaching%20from%20the%20University%20of%20West%20Georgia.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228192%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Jodi%20Sprague%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa30580cc23a829a3b900f3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225464%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EJodi%20said%20she%20is%20worried%20about%20making%20her%20student-loan%20payment%20before%20her%20next%20paycheck%20comes.%3Cp%3EAlyssa%20Pointer%20for%20BI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20took%20the%20maximum%20out%2C%26quot%3B%20Jodi%2C%20now%20a%20middle%20school%20teacher%2C%20said.%20%26quot%3BWe%20were%20able%20to%20survive%20because%20of%20the%20student-loan%20money.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESurvival%20has%20shaped%20the%20Spragues.%20Two%20years%20ago%2C%20a%20tree%20split%20open%20the%20roof%20of%20their%20home.%20For%20a%20whole%20school%20year%2C%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Ethe%20family%20of%20four%20lived%20in%20a%20small%20rental%20with%20their%20dog%20Bailey%2C%20while%20their%20home%20underwent%20repairs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20was%20absolutely%20devastating%20for%20our%20family%20to%20be%20literally%20displaced%2C%26quot%3B%20Jodi%20said.%20%26quot%3BBut%20again%2C%20we%20learned%20so%20much%20from%20it.%20We%20learned%20that%20we%20don't%20need%20that%20much.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20first%20moment%20Evelyn%20and%20Olivia%20knew%20they%20weren't%20rich%20was%20when%20everyone%20at%20kindergarten%20had%20American%20Girl%20Dolls%2C%20but%20they%20didn't.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThey%20asked%20for%20Christmas%20presents%20in%20July%20to%20give%20their%20parents%20more%20time%20to%20save%20up%3B%20one%20year%2C%20Olivia%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Egot%20a%20bottle%20of%20Chick-fil-A%20Polynesian%20sauce%20while%20her%20friends%20were%20getting%20iPads%20and%20cash.%20When%20Evelyn's%20friends%20wanted%20to%20go%20out%20to%20dinner%2C%20she%20was%20often%20the%20one%20to%20say%20no%20%E2%80%94%20she%20had%20to%20wait%20for%20her%20next%20paycheck%20from%20Whataburger.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%202011%2C%20when%20the%20daughters%20were%20toddlers%2C%20Jodi%20accumulated%20credit%20card%20debt%20she%20couldn't%20repay%2C%20and%20the%20Spragues%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstudent-loan-borrowers-bankruptcy-more-success-discharging-debt-new-guidance-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efiled%20for%20bankruptcy%3C%2Fa%3E.%20One%20day%2C%20she%20didn't%20know%20how%20she'd%20afford%20groceries%20%E2%80%94%20until%20an%20%2480%20refund%20check%20from%20a%20dentist%20appointment%20arrived%20in%20the%20mail.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20just%20broke%20down%2C%26quot%3B%20Jodi%20said.%20%26quot%3BThat's%20how%20tight%20it%20was.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEvelyn%20and%20Olivia%20were%20too%20young%20to%20understand%20what%20bankruptcy%20meant.%20Jodi%20and%20Paul%20made%20it%20their%20mission%20to%20do%20what%20their%20parents%20hadn't.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe've%20always%20had%20an%20open%20dialogue%20about%20money%20because%20my%20parents%20were%20the%20opposite%2C%26quot%3B%20Jodi%20said.%20%26quot%3BThey%20didn't%20teach%20us%20anything.%20Everything%20was%20secret%2C%20secret.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228192%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Jodi%20Sprague%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa305ae9b8974787b1cab92%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225464%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EJodi%20and%20Olivia%20show%20their%20matching%20tattoos%20(Evelyn%20is%20too%20young%2C%20but%20she%20has%20plans%20for%20ink%20the%20minute%20she%20turns%2018).%3Cp%3EAlyssa%20Pointer%20for%20BI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOlivia%20recalled%20an%20added%20pressure%20that%20came%20with%20those%20financial%20lessons.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20remember%20being%20in%20the%20car%20line%20in%20the%20morning%2C%20and%20my%20mom%20was%20like%2C%20'You%20have%20to%20get%20good%20grades%20so%20you%20can%20go%20to%20school%20for%20free%2C'%26quot%3B%20Olivia%20said.%20%26quot%3BSo%20it's%20always%20been%20in%20the%20back%20of%20my%20mind%20that%20school%20is%20really%20expensive.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EAyelet%20Sheffey%20covers%20all%20things%20student%20debt%2C%20from%20the%20latest%20Education%20Department%20news%20to%20stories%20of%20borrowers%20navigating%20their%20loans.%20To%20stay%20up%20to%20date%20on%20her%20coverage%2C%20sign%20up%20to%20get%20email%20alerts%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fauthor%2Fayelet-sheffey%3Ffollow-me%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3Efor%20her%20new%20stories%20here%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EIn%20high%20school%2C%20Olivia%20got%20an%2089%25%20on%20a%20biology%20test%20and%20cried%20so%20much%20that%20she%20had%20to%20go%20home%3B%20she%20worried%20the%20B%2B%20would%20ruin%20her%20chances%20at%20a%20scholarship.%20In%207th%20grade%2C%20Evelyn%20started%20a%20spreadsheet%20mapping%20out%20potential%20college%20courses%20and%20their%20costs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BUnfortunately%2C%20it's%20probably%20put%20a%20lot%20of%20pressure%20on%20them%2C%26quot%3B%20Paul%20said.%20%26quot%3BBut%20that's%20what%20it%20is.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOlivia%20received%20Georgia's%20HOPE%20scholarship%2C%20but%20it%20didn't%20cover%20her%20full%20tuition.%20So%20Jodi%20took%20out%20%2419%2C000%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fparent-plus-student-loan-borrowers-debt-relief-deadline-idr-trump-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ein%20parent%20PLUS%20loans%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20Olivia's%20first%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENow%2C%20with%20the%20family's%20tighter%20budget%2C%20Olivia%20is%20taking%20out%20%246%2C000%20this%20semester%20%E2%80%94%20the%20most%20she%20can%20borrow%20federally%20%E2%80%94%20to%20cover%20her%20rent%20and%20other%20expenses%20and%20prevent%20Jodi%20from%20borrowing%20further.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20can't%20really%20take%20the%20time%20to%20pick%20up%20another%20job%20because%20I'd%20be%20putting%20my%20schoolwork%20on%20the%20back%20burner%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Olivia%2C%20who's%20studying%20public%20relations.%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%26quot%3BSo%20I'd%20rather%20just%20deal%20with%20it%20later%2C%20with%20my%20student%20loans.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEvelyn%20is%20now%20applying%20to%20colleges%2C%20and%20while%20she%20dreams%20of%20playing%20in%20a%20band%2C%20she's%20pursuing%20forensic%20pathology%20instead.%20However%2C%20the%20cost%20of%20a%20medical%20degree%20has%20her%20second-guessing%20that%20route.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPaul%2C%2060%2C%20has%20looked%20into%20taking%20on%20a%20second%20job.%20He%20said%20retirement%20is%20%26quot%3Bjust%20not%20a%20reality%20right%20now.%26quot%3B%20If%20it%20came%20down%20to%20it%2C%20he%20said%20he%20would%20look%20at%20using%20his%20life%20insurance%20to%20help%20his%20daughters%20pay%20off%20any%20debt%20they%20accumulate.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228192%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20Spragues%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa41e2ecc23a829a3b905bf%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225464%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Spragues%20are%20coming%20together%20to%20navigate%20the%20student-loan%20increase%2C%20from%20cutting%20back%20on%20subscriptions%20to%20taking%20on%20more%20household%20chores.%3Cp%3EAlyssa%20Pointer%20for%20BI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20family%20has%20also%20started%20making%20smaller%20sacrifices.%20They've%20cut%20back%20on%20their%20streaming%20subscriptions%20and%20canceled%20their%20September%20vacation%20to%20Florida.%20Paul%20is%20learning%20simple%20mechanical%20fixes%20for%20his%20car%20instead%20of%20taking%20it%20to%20the%20shop.%20Olivia%20decided%20not%20to%20rush%20a%20sorority%20because%20of%20the%20cost.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJodi%20has%20about%20three%20years%20of%20payments%20left%20toward%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-sued-pslf-rule-limit-student-loan-forgiveness-new-lawsuit-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EPublic%20Service%20Loan%20Forgiveness%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20forgives%20student%20debt%20for%20government%20and%20nonprofit%20workers%2C%20like%20teachers%2C%20after%2010%20years%20of%20qualifying%20payments.%20She's%20concerned%20that%20the%20higher%20payments%20will%20push%20back%20that%20timeline%20if%20she%20falls%20behind.%20The%20stakes%20are%20also%20higher%20because%20the%20Education%20Department%20now%20requires%20PSLF%20payments%20on%20new%20income-driven%20repayment%20plans%20to%20be%20made%20exactly%20on%20the%20due%20date%20%E2%80%94%20there%20was%20previously%20a%20grace%20period%20%E2%80%94%20or%20they%20will%20not%20count%20toward%20PSLF%20progress.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOther%20student-loan%20borrowers%20are%20facing%20similar%20pressures.%20More%20will%20start%20transitioning%20off%20the%20SAVE%20plan%20in%20the%20coming%20months%20and%20face%20higher%20payments.%20Some%20borrowers%20said%20they're%20concerned%20about%20defaulting%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstudent-loan-debt-repayment-glitches-borrower-budget-credit-scores-errors-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efacing%20wage%20garnishment%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20the%20seizure%20of%20federal%20benefits%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstudent-loan-borrowers-social-security-garnishment-debt-default-bernie-sanders-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esuch%20as%20Social%20Security%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPaul%20and%20Jodi%20said%20that%20while%20they%20believed%20setting%20Evelyn%20and%20Olivia%20up%20for%20college%20was%20in%20their%20best%20interests%2C%20they%20would%20still%20support%20them%20if%20they%20decided%20not%20to%20go.%20Jodi%20teaches%20her%20seventh-grade%20students%20that%20college%20isn't%20always%20worth%20the%20investment%2C%20and%20that%20they%20could%20be%20better%20off%20pursuing%20trade%20school.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPaul%20learned%20that%20lesson%20decades%20