s%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fclaude-code-boris-cherny-better-way-measure-ai-success-dashboards-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EBoris%20Cherny%3C%2Fa%3E%20posted%20an%20email%20a%20developer%20wrote%20to%20him%20on%20X.%20The%20email%20was%20titled%3A%20%26quot%3BWhat%20to%20do%20about%20slop%3F%26quot%3B%20Cherny%20wrote%20that%20he%20receives%20emails%20like%20this%20every%20day%20and%20that%20he%20tries%20to%20respond%20to%20as%20many%20as%20possible.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20no%20surprise%20that%20developers%20are%20reaching%20out%20to%20Cherny%20with%20their%20worries.%20AI%20has%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgreat-coding-reset-ai-software-engineering-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eradically%20changed%20coding%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20shifting%20job%20descriptions%20and%20turning%20engineers%20into%20reviewers.%20Some%20engineers%20love%20the%20ease%3B%20others%20call%20it%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-software-engineer-leaves-ai-coding-lonely-draining-2026-8%3Fgift-id%3D3i_EGPSd5lynrZh6THvCuA%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Elonely%20and%20tedious%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20the%20email%2C%20the%20unnamed%20developer%20wrote%20that%20the%20shift%20to%20AI%20coding%20was%20causing%20%26quot%3Bfriction.%26quot%3B%20He%20broke%20it%20down%20into%20two%20views%20and%20asked%20Cherny%20to%20broker%20the%20dispute.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20first%20view%20was%20a%20more%20restrained%20use%20of%20AI%20tools%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cblockquote%3E%3Csection%3EWe%20create%20code%20similar%20to%20before%2C%20accelerated%20by%20AI.%20We%20may%20not%20review%20all%20of%20it%2C%20but%20it%20should%20be%20reviewable.%20The%20person%20submitting%20the%20code%20should%20be%20able%20to%20explain%20it.%20It%20should%20be%20built%20in%20such%20a%20way%20to%20make%20it%20as%20easy%20to%20maintain%20%E2%80%94%C2%A0or%20easier%20%E2%80%94%C2%A0than%20before%2C%20by%20human%20agents.%3C%2Fsection%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20second%20view%20was%20more%20permissive.%20This%20was%20the%20vibe%20coding%20position%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cblockquote%3E%3Csection%3EWe%20treat%20the%20code%20as%20a%20black%20box.%20We%20don't%20worry%20about%20it.%20We%20just%20check%20the%20output.%3C%2Fsection%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20developer%20wrote%20that%20many%20people%20were%20incapable%20of%20doing%20option%201%20%E2%80%94%20the%20more%20restrained%20approach%20%E2%80%94%C2%A0but%20worried%20about%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flist-companies-replacing-human-employees-with-ai-layoffs-workforce-reductions%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Egetting%20laid%20off%3C%2Fa%3E.%20%26quot%3BA%20lot%20of%20people%20are%20just%20forcing%20it%2C%26quot%3B%20they%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECherny%20posted%20his%20response%20in%20full.%20As%20for%20the%20two%20options%20the%20developer%20provided%2C%20Cherny%20said%20there%20was%20room%20for%20both.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20the%20%26quot%3Bdon't%20worry%26quot%3B%20approach%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cblockquote%3E%3Csection%3EPrototypes%20and%20other%20throw-away%20code%20can%20be%20treated%20as%20totally%20black%20box.%20If%20you're%20going%20to%20throw%20it%20away%20anyway%2C%20and%20if%20the%20blast%20radius%20of%20it%20breaking%20is%20low%2C%20it%20doesn't%20need%20to%20be%20perfect.%3C%2Fsection%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%2C%20on%20cautious%20reviewing%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cblockquote%3E%3Csection%3EProduction%20code%20written%20by%20Claude%20should%20have%20a%20higher%20bar%20than%20if%20it%20was%20written%20by%20a%20human.%20At%20Anthropic%2C%20we%20have%20many%20guardrails%20in%20place%20to%20make%20sure%20this%20is%20happening%3A%20lots%20of%20lint%20rules%2C%20lots%20of%20tests%2C%20Claude-driven%20end%20to%20end%20tests%2C%20Claude-powered%20fuzzers%20running%20daily%2C%20automated%20code%20reviews%20and%20security%20reviews%2C%20automated%20code%20refactoring%2C%20and%20so%20on.%20Without%20these%2C%20you%20can%20end%20up%20with%20a%20mess%20that%20is%20hard%20to%20maintain%20down%20the%20line.%20Luckily%2C%20the%20model%20makes%20it%20increasingly%20easy%20to%20do%20these%20well%20%E2%80%94%20run%20a%20few%20daily%20routines%2C%20use%20Claude%20Code%20Review%2C%20etc.%3C%2Fsection%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20developer's%20job%20is%20to%20%26quot%3Bhold%20the%20bar%20on%20code%20quality%2C%26quot%3B%20Cherny%20wrote.%20AI%20leaders%20use%20different%20terms%20for%20this%20role%2C%20such%20as%20%26quot%3B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-agent-managers-vercel-guillermo-rauch-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emini%20CEO%3C%2Fa%3E.%26quot%3B%20It's%20the%20developer's%20job%20to%20act%20like%20a%20manager%2C%20stopping%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-writing-all-startup-code-thats-creating-a-new-problem-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebad%20code%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20its%20tracks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20all%20else%20fails%2C%20Cherny%20said%20the%20developer%20could%20be%20more%20hands-on%20with%20Claude%20or%20ask%20it%20to%20rewrite%20the%20codebase.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BOr%2C%20wait%20for%20the%20next%20model%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fclaude-codes-creator-email-ai-slop-reply-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789206421000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa413d0ec15fe2d3cf163d2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fclaude-codes-creator-email-ai-slop-reply-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22A%20developer%20emailed%20Claude%20Code%20creator%20Boris%20Cherny%20that%20AI%20coding%20had%20created%20%26quot%3Bfriction.%26quot%3B%20Cherny%20posted%20his%20full%20response.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22hchandonnet%40businessinsider.com%20(Henry%20Chandonnet)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl